(5719451, 832032, 65562, '<td valign="top">im not sure what im looking at... some sort of metal object im assuming</td>', 'im not sure what im looking at... some sort of metal object im assuming', '2009-11-09 00:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719452, 831048, 811, '<td valign="top">cades cove?</td>', 'cades cove?', '2009-11-09 00:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719478, 832583, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like this, though it comes off a bit dark on my monitor.</td>', 'I like this, though it comes off a bit dark on my monitor.', '2009-11-09 00:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719482, 831475, 65562, '<td valign="top">the halos around the edges are very distracting</td>', 'the halos around the edges are very distracting', '2009-11-09 00:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719485, 832407, 83313, '<td valign="top">Still working on the camera movement, I see. I like this, though I am curious to see if this is appreciated by the masses on the heels of the camera movement challenge.</td>', 'Still working on the camera movement, I see. I like this, though I am curious to see if this is appreciated by the masses on the heels of the camera movement challenge.', '2009-11-09 00:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719487, 831601, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice use of framing.</td>', 'Nice use of framing.', '2009-11-09 00:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719492, 830002, 83313, '<td valign="top">Colors seems  little odd here, I''m afraid. Almost pastel in nature. Not sure what may have done this. I suspect you may have been trying for an effect or treatment that didn''t come off to me the way you intended.</td>', 'Colors seems  little odd here, I''m afraid. Almost pastel in nature. Not sure what may have done this. I suspect you may have been trying for an effect or treatment that didn''t come off to me the way you intended.', '2009-11-09 00:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719505, 832032, 18197, '<td valign="top">I really like the abstract nature of this. Very well composed.</td>', 'I really like the abstract nature of this. Very well composed.', '2009-11-09 00:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719507, 829980, 33672, '<td valign="top">I love Robert Frost.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-11-23 13:23:16.</i></td>', 'I love Robert Frost.', '2009-11-09 00:26:15.000000', '2009-11-23 13:23:16.000000', 1),
(5719520, 829024, 34938, '<td valign="top">stunning...love the location and colours 8</td>', 'stunning...love the location and colours 8', '2009-11-09 00:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719531, 832243, 34938, '<td valign="top">beautiful...love the light in this...9</td>', 'beautiful...love the light in this...9', '2009-11-09 00:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719538, 832426, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the impressionistic feeling here. The patterns of color juxtaposed against the dark trunks is very effective. Well done.</td>', 'I like the impressionistic feeling here. The patterns of color juxtaposed against the dark trunks is very effective. Well done.', '2009-11-09 00:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719543, 829418, 34938, '<td valign="top">a winner...good luck with this 9</td>', 'a winner...good luck with this 9', '2009-11-09 00:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719544, 831021, 18197, '<td valign="top">The tilted composition works very well here. I likr yjr volors, too. Well seen and processed.</td>', 'The tilted composition works very well here. I likr yjr volors, too. Well seen and processed.', '2009-11-09 00:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719546, 830228, 18197, '<td valign="top">Neat building. Love the encroachment by the ivy. Terrific processing. Great work.</td>', 'Neat building. Love the encroachment by the ivy. Terrific processing. Great work.', '2009-11-09 00:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719551, 831879, 34938, '<td valign="top">lovely...like a painting 8</td>', 'lovely...like a painting 8', '2009-11-09 00:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719563, 831767, 56579, '<td valign="top">The saturation is an awkward level.  I think it would look better with more saturation...if nothing else increasing it in the orange/yellow range would help a lot better</td>', 'The saturation is an awkward level.  I think it would look better with more saturation...if nothing else increasing it in the orange/yellow range would help a lot better', '2009-11-09 00:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719565, 832490, 56579, '<td valign="top">a polarizing filter to reduce reflection could have helped this shot a lot</td>', 'a polarizing filter to reduce reflection could have helped this shot a lot', '2009-11-09 00:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719590, 832422, 93565, '<td valign="top">Lost a bit of details in your sky there. I might have considered doing a multi-exposure HDR for this scene to alleviate that blown out portion or possibly underexposed the rest of the scene more and tonemapped. The tones of your foliage and rolling greens, on the other hand, are superb. Very good pastoral feeling.</td>', 'Lost a bit of details in your sky there. I might have considered doing a multi-exposure HDR for this scene to alleviate that blown out portion or possibly underexposed the rest of the scene more and tonemapped. The tones of your foliage and rolling greens, on the other hand, are superb. Very good pastoral feeling.', '2009-11-09 01:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719592, 832358, 31637, '<td valign="top">Magical! excellent tones, and composition; but I''m afraid this isn''t giving the Autumn vibe and it cost it a point or two, but I''ll still vote 7.</td>', 'Magical! excellent tones, and composition; but I''m afraid this isn''t giving the Autumn vibe and it cost it a point or two, but I''ll still vote 7.', '2009-11-09 01:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719604, 831010, 93565, '<td valign="top">An overall lack of sharpness and contrast make this photo look a lot flatter than it likely is. The time of day this was shot at and the weather might have influenced this. You might also take some dings from people because your foliage is a largely a secondary subject here.</td>', 'An overall lack of sharpness and contrast make this photo look a lot flatter than it likely is. The time of day this was shot at and the weather might have influenced this. You might also take some dings from people because your foliage is a largely a secondary subject here.', '2009-11-09 01:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719605, 832390, 93565, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective on the leaves. I like the sawtooth edges and the fine hairs that you have captured. Nice variety of hue and good use of DoF to make things interesting.</td>', 'Interesting perspective on the leaves. I like the sawtooth edges and the fine hairs that you have captured. Nice variety of hue and good use of DoF to make things interesting.', '2009-11-09 01:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719607, 831641, 93565, '<td valign="top">Though perhaps not a traditional approach in landscape photography, tilting the frame has moments where it adds greatly to the scene, adding interest to the composition. In this shot, though, I''m not too sure I see what it adds. Having the long parallel lines of the trees and then tilting them adds a rather unharmonious air to things... contradicting the tranquility.</td>', 'Though perhaps not a traditional approach in landscape photography, tilting the frame has moments where it adds greatly to the scene, adding interest to the composition. In this shot, though, I''m not too sure I see what it adds. Having the long parallel lines of the trees and then tilting them adds a rather unharmonious air to things... contradicting the tranquility.', '2009-11-09 01:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719608, 831704, 93565, '<td valign="top">Very nice complement of colors with the auto. Also, that car is a kick in the ass to drive!</td>', 'Very nice complement of colors with the auto. Also, that car is a kick in the ass to drive!', '2009-11-09 01:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719609, 832490, 103916, '<td valign="top">I would of liked to of seen less of the reflective light in the water...and more of the reds and browns of the leaves ( I am assuming that the leaves are under water?)</td>', 'I would of liked to of seen less of the reflective light in the water...and more of the reds and browns of the leaves ( I am assuming that the leaves are under water?)', '2009-11-09 01:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719610, 832291, 103916, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors!</td>', 'Beautiful colors!', '2009-11-09 01:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719612, 830469, 103916, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene...I love the rays of sunshine in the far distance.  I would of liked to of seen more of the colors of the tress.  But, nice colors!</td>', 'Beautiful scene...I love the rays of sunshine in the far distance.  I would of liked to of seen more of the colors of the tress.  But, nice colors!', '2009-11-09 01:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719614, 832243, 103916, '<td valign="top">It seems to me that it is either a bit blurry.  Nice idea!</td>', 'It seems to me that it is either a bit blurry.  Nice idea!', '2009-11-09 01:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719616, 830085, 103916, '<td valign="top">Nice...but, it seems to dark in the distance closer to the viewer.</td>', 'Nice...but, it seems to dark in the distance closer to the viewer.', '2009-11-09 01:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719618, 830010, 103916, '<td valign="top">Very soft and delicate.  Very dreamy and peaceful photograph.</td>', 'Very soft and delicate.  Very dreamy and peaceful photograph.', '2009-11-09 01:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719620, 832095, 103916, '<td valign="top">Some of the shadows of the droplets seem to be distracting to me.  Great idea but, perhaps next time it would be good to try and cast out the shadows.</td>', 'Some of the shadows of the droplets seem to be distracting to me.  Great idea but, perhaps next time it would be good to try and cast out the shadows.', '2009-11-09 01:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719621, 830306, 103916, '<td valign="top">Great photograph during the Harvest Season!</td>', 'Great photograph during the Harvest Season!', '2009-11-09 01:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719622, 832292, 103916, '<td valign="top">Great CloseUp...</td>', 'Great CloseUp...', '2009-11-09 01:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719623, 830064, 93565, '<td valign="top">I''m going to assume that your colors are more subdued because of when this challenge was announced and that the fall colors were well past prime where you took this. I live south in Colorado, and know things were well past for me. Still, a good shot. The front and center treebranch in the foreground and the plants in the lower right detract somewhat though.</td>', 'I''m going to assume that your colors are more subdued because of when this challenge was announced and that the fall colors were well past prime where you took this. I live south in Colorado, and know things were well past for me. Still, a good shot. The front and center treebranch in the foreground and the plants in the lower right detract somewhat though.', '2009-11-09 01:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719624, 832386, 103916, '<td valign="top">Seems to be out of focus or too focused.</td>', 'Seems to be out of focus or too focused.', '2009-11-09 01:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719625, 832630, 93565, '<td valign="top">The colors are almost a bit to vibrant here. The trees to the right are clipping pretty badly unfortunately. It''s unfortunate, because I really like the lines of the bridge and the perspective here.</td>', 'The colors are almost a bit to vibrant here. The trees to the right are clipping pretty badly unfortunately. It''s unfortunate, because I really like the lines of the bridge and the perspective here.', '2009-11-09 01:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719627, 832532, 103916, '<td valign="top">Great photograph!!!</td>', 'Great photograph!!!', '2009-11-09 01:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719629, 830228, 93565, '<td valign="top">Interesting building, and I like the ominous sky. It makes this building look all the more menacing. I would''ve preferred it be centered, since the minimal offset seems almost incidental. I suspect you have a power substatoin to the right that may have prevented this though...</td>', 'Interesting building, and I like the ominous sky. It makes this building look all the more menacing. I would''ve preferred it be centered, since the minimal offset seems almost incidental. I suspect you have a power substatoin to the right that may have prevented this though...', '2009-11-09 01:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719630, 830083, 103916, '<td valign="top">Very neat picture!</td>', 'Very neat picture!', '2009-11-09 01:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719631, 830529, 93565, '<td valign="top">I really like how the subtle distortions of the window have made this look very painting like. In some areas it is almost as though it''s an impressionistic painting, but others it is sharp and photo-like. Nice job.</td>', 'I really like how the subtle distortions of the window have made this look very painting like. In some areas it is almost as though it''s an impressionistic painting, but others it is sharp and photo-like. Nice job.', '2009-11-09 01:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719633, 830980, 93565, '<td valign="top">I kinda wish the foliage was more of a focal point in this</td>', 'I kinda wish the foliage was more of a focal point in this', '2009-11-09 01:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719634, 832292, 93565, '<td valign="top">Very nice textures in both the leaf and ice.Interesting photo.</td>', 'Very nice textures in both the leaf and ice.Interesting photo.', '2009-11-09 01:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719635, 832540, 103916, '<td valign="top">Excellent Photograph!</td>', 'Excellent Photograph!', '2009-11-09 01:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719636, 831094, 103916, '<td valign="top">Kinda gives you a headache if you try and focus on the actual subject.</td>', 'Kinda gives you a headache if you try and focus on the actual subject.', '2009-11-09 01:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719637, 830506, 93565, '<td valign="top">I can''t decide if I like or dislike the defocus on this one hmmmmmmmmmmm<br/>Subject matter is pleasing but somewhat cliche/typical.</td>', 'I can''t decide if I like or dislike the defocus on this one hmmmmmmmmmmmSubject matter is pleasing but somewhat cliche/typical.', '2009-11-09 01:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719639, 830083, 36371, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking!</td>', 'Breathtaking!', '2009-11-09 01:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719640, 831879, 103916, '<td valign="top">Love it!  The Fog is incredible...</td>', 'Love it!  The Fog is incredible...', '2009-11-09 01:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719641, 830835, 36371, '<td valign="top">love this</td>', 'love this', '2009-11-09 01:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719643, 831208, 36371, '<td valign="top">cool idea</td>', 'cool idea', '2009-11-09 01:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719644, 830681, 103916, '<td valign="top">Incredible PHotograph!!!!</td>', 'Incredible PHotograph!!!!', '2009-11-09 01:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719645, 832605, 93565, '<td valign="top">There appears to be some lensflare that doesn''t help the composition here. The coloration and contrast of the foliage looks a bit flat as well. Adding more pop would''ve made the foliage fit more with the color and definition of the sky/buildings.</td>', 'There appears to be some lensflare that doesn''t help the composition here. The coloration and contrast of the foliage looks a bit flat as well. Adding more pop would''ve made the foliage fit more with the color and definition of the sky/buildings.', '2009-11-09 01:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719647, 832447, 93565, '<td valign="top">Not too sure why you only went up to 510 pixels on this...<br/>More interest could have been added to the subject by taking your photo closer and at an angle of some sort to make it seem more tremendous or towering.</td>', 'Not too sure why you only went up to 510 pixels on this...More interest could have been added to the subject by taking your photo closer and at an angle of some sort to make it seem more tremendous or towering.', '2009-11-09 01:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719648, 830211, 93565, '<td valign="top">I really like the variegated leaves here. Nice variety of colors as well, ranging from indigo to yellow and orange. You''ve also got a few different patterns on the leaves too.</td>', 'I really like the variegated leaves here. Nice variety of colors as well, ranging from indigo to yellow and orange. You''ve also got a few different patterns on the leaves too.', '2009-11-09 01:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719650, 832432, 93565, '<td valign="top">Great use of DoF here. It seems lik things should be a little bit sharper, but I like it.</td>', 'Great use of DoF here. It seems lik things should be a little bit sharper, but I like it.', '2009-11-09 01:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719652, 829484, 93565, '<td valign="top">For this, I would have preferred a deeper DoF and a bit less closely cropped into the leaf. <br/>I very much like the leaf you''ve selected- great variety of colors and texture, and being able to see the tension on the water surface is very interesting.</td>', 'For this, I would have preferred a deeper DoF and a bit less closely cropped into the leaf. I very much like the leaf you''ve selected- great variety of colors and texture, and being able to see the tension on the water surface is very interesting.', '2009-11-09 01:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719654, 830681, 93565, '<td valign="top">I''m going to assume (I may be wrong) that you planted (har har) this leaf here, but I like the idea. Maybe increasing the contrast and making the trees darker would add some impact here, but good idea nonetheless.</td>', 'I''m going to assume (I may be wrong) that you planted (har har) this leaf here, but I like the idea. Maybe increasing the contrast and making the trees darker would add some impact here, but good idea nonetheless.', '2009-11-09 02:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719655, 830083, 93565, '<td valign="top">Very nicely chosen path for this type of shot. The idea is a bit typical, but you''ve separated yourself with an immaculately covered walkway. Nice locale scouting, and you''ve even got nice vanishing points. You also did a good job not oversaturating your foliage, which many other entries have tended towards.</td>', 'Very nicely chosen path for this type of shot. The idea is a bit typical, but you''ve separated yourself with an immaculately covered walkway. Nice locale scouting, and you''ve even got nice vanishing points. You also did a good job not oversaturating your foliage, which many other entries have tended towards.', '2009-11-09 02:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719657, 830256, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice Lensbaby shot.  Good composition in finding a main subject of majority of red leaves surrounded by a majority of yellow foliage.  I like the sweet spot on the concentrated area of red leaves.  Fantastic colors.  Well thought out.  Best of luck in the voting.</td>', 'Nice Lensbaby shot.  Good composition in finding a main subject of majority of red leaves surrounded by a majority of yellow foliage.  I like the sweet spot on the concentrated area of red leaves.  Fantastic colors.  Well thought out.  Best of luck in the voting.', '2009-11-09 02:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719662, 832345, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  Initial thought was a Lensbaby lens, but doesn''t quite have that blur.   Use of a zoom lens?  No matter, I like the center composition and the blur effect that you achieved.</td>', 'Nice colors.  Initial thought was a Lensbaby lens, but doesn''t quite have that blur.   Use of a zoom lens?  No matter, I like the center composition and the blur effect that you achieved.', '2009-11-09 02:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719666, 829585, 103032, '<td valign="top">Brilliant colors.  Has an oil painting quality to it.  Like the effect you achieved.  Best wishes on the voting.</td>', 'Brilliant colors.  Has an oil painting quality to it.  Like the effect you achieved.  Best wishes on the voting.', '2009-11-09 02:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719698, 831648, 77521, '<td valign="top">unfortunately i cannot vote on this but if i could it would be a ten, i love when photographers go out of their way to create art, not just snap a picture! good luck!</td>', 'unfortunately i cannot vote on this but if i could it would be a ten, i love when photographers go out of their way to create art, not just snap a picture! good luck!', '2009-11-09 02:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
