(5719831, 832499, 99710, '<td valign="top">I like our subject, but I think on a different time of day or a different perspective would make this photo a lot better.</td>', 'I like our subject, but I think on a different time of day or a different perspective would make this photo a lot better.', '2009-11-09 05:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
