(5719893, 830506, 28564, '<td valign="top">very good atmosphere here... nice!</td>', 'very good atmosphere here... nice!', '2009-11-09 06:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719894, 830469, 28564, '<td valign="top">awesome photograph here, compliments.</td>', 'awesome photograph here, compliments.', '2009-11-09 06:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719896, 832620, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a really interesting and unusual take on the theme. It''s an interesting subject, though I''m not sure if it makes the best shot the way you have presented it.<br/> <br/>All the colours are a bit samey, and the composition is very centred and front on. I like the sharp detail at the top, but it falls off and becomes a little soft towards the bottom.<br/> <br/>Overall, a nice find but I think a change of composition and perhaps processing to emphasise details rather than colour.</td>', 'This is a really interesting and unusual take on the theme. It''s an interesting subject, though I''m not sure if it makes the best shot the way you have presented it. All the colours are a bit samey, and the composition is very centred and front on. I like the sharp detail at the top, but it falls off and becomes a little soft towards the bottom. Overall, a nice find but I think a change of composition and perhaps processing to emphasise details rather than colour.', '2009-11-09 06:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719897, 829196, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a little untidy and lacks any real point of interest. The colours seem a tiny bit flat as well and your "reds" are lost in the green.</td>', 'This is a little untidy and lacks any real point of interest. The colours seem a tiny bit flat as well and your "reds" are lost in the green.', '2009-11-09 06:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719899, 832399, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and a crisp (forgive the pun), clear macro. I think I would have liked it more if I could make out all of at least one leaf as the shape is really interesting rather than just have them all overlap.</td>', 'Nice colours and a crisp (forgive the pun), clear macro. I think I would have liked it more if I could make out all of at least one leaf as the shape is really interesting rather than just have them all overlap.', '2009-11-09 06:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719900, 832134, 101117, '<td valign="top">The carpet makes a nice lead up to the trees, but I think it would be nicer if I could actually see the trees to the tops.</td>', 'The carpet makes a nice lead up to the trees, but I think it would be nicer if I could actually see the trees to the tops.', '2009-11-09 06:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719901, 832555, 101117, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge. I like the strong colours and yellow and blue always go well together. I think the idea is great, the motion makes it interesting, but I think perhaps a touch too much for me.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge. I like the strong colours and yellow and blue always go well together. I think the idea is great, the motion makes it interesting, but I think perhaps a touch too much for me.', '2009-11-09 06:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719905, 831642, 101117, '<td valign="top">There''s not really a lot of foliage in this, other than the single bare tree (and I suppose the grass), but I''m not going to be too harsh for that. <br/> <br/>I like the lighting here, it''s clearly a long exposure but you have some really nice natural lighting in the foreground, good job in that sense.</td>', 'There''s not really a lot of foliage in this, other than the single bare tree (and I suppose the grass), but I''m not going to be too harsh for that.  I like the lighting here, it''s clearly a long exposure but you have some really nice natural lighting in the foreground, good job in that sense.', '2009-11-09 06:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719906, 832628, 28564, '<td valign="top">very very attractive shot... maybe i would not have included the little portion of the sky, but is a good photograph.</td>', 'very very attractive shot... maybe i would not have included the little portion of the sky, but is a good photograph.', '2009-11-09 06:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719907, 831629, 28564, '<td valign="top">even if we do not see the colors is a good way to represent the fall season...</td>', 'even if we do not see the colors is a good way to represent the fall season...', '2009-11-09 06:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719908, 829546, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, though I''m not a big fan of the framing of the falls themselves.</td>', 'Nice colours, though I''m not a big fan of the framing of the falls themselves.', '2009-11-09 06:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719909, 831836, 101117, '<td valign="top">Lots of detail and nice colours here. I do think the shot is a touch overexposed making it almost sore to look at.</td>', 'Lots of detail and nice colours here. I do think the shot is a touch overexposed making it almost sore to look at.', '2009-11-09 06:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719910, 829637, 101117, '<td valign="top">Very nice landscape, though I''m not sure if you have chosen the best time of the day to take this. The large shadow line along both sides makes it difficult to see the details because of the contrast with the bright area.</td>', 'Very nice landscape, though I''m not sure if you have chosen the best time of the day to take this. The large shadow line along both sides makes it difficult to see the details because of the contrast with the bright area.', '2009-11-09 06:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719911, 832063, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice colours in the trees, though I see the sky has let you down a little, not much you could do about that though. Not sure if I like the framing here, I feel like I want to see further up the river.</td>', 'Nice colours in the trees, though I see the sky has let you down a little, not much you could do about that though. Not sure if I like the framing here, I feel like I want to see further up the river.', '2009-11-09 06:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719912, 832461, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice shot with some great colours. It isn''t instantly obvious what your subject is as it blends in with the background, but I think that''s a good thing as it makes the shot more subtle.</td>', 'Nice shot with some great colours. It isn''t instantly obvious what your subject is as it blends in with the background, but I think that''s a good thing as it makes the shot more subtle.', '2009-11-09 06:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719913, 832023, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a bit unusual, I''m wondering what that is framing the leaf, I''m guessing it''s some sort of fence and I don''t think it''s worked particularly well as it''s a touch harsh against what is otherwise a nice soft shot.<br/> <br/>The processing and lighting give this a really nice feel.</td>', 'This is a bit unusual, I''m wondering what that is framing the leaf, I''m guessing it''s some sort of fence and I don''t think it''s worked particularly well as it''s a touch harsh against what is otherwise a nice soft shot. The processing and lighting give this a really nice feel.', '2009-11-09 06:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719914, 828853, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice colours but I don''t really like the composition. The background colours are great as well, I think a different framing of this would have made it a lot better for me.</td>', 'Nice colours but I don''t really like the composition. The background colours are great as well, I think a different framing of this would have made it a lot better for me.', '2009-11-09 06:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719915, 830183, 101117, '<td valign="top">I like all of this apart from two things, the big tree trunk and what I''m guessing is a path running along the top.</td>', 'I like all of this apart from two things, the big tree trunk and what I''m guessing is a path running along the top.', '2009-11-09 06:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719917, 830080, 101117, '<td valign="top">While this is quite a nice shot, I think the colours are a touch flat, which is a shame because I can see some potentially strong colours from the fallen leaves there. I think a change of lighting or perhaps processing would have brought them out nicer.</td>', 'While this is quite a nice shot, I think the colours are a touch flat, which is a shame because I can see some potentially strong colours from the fallen leaves there. I think a change of lighting or perhaps processing would have brought them out nicer.', '2009-11-09 06:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719919, 828914, 101117, '<td valign="top">Very nice rich red colours and good composition. I like the simplicity of this shot and the way the foreground subject is lit against the darker background to emphasise it.</td>', 'Very nice rich red colours and good composition. I like the simplicity of this shot and the way the foreground subject is lit against the darker background to emphasise it.', '2009-11-09 06:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719928, 832616, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and detail. I think the shot might be a little busy, there''s a lot in focus so while the central subject is apparent I don''t find my eye settles on it well, rather I keep looking around at the other stuff.</td>', 'Nice colours and detail. I think the shot might be a little busy, there''s a lot in focus so while the central subject is apparent I don''t find my eye settles on it well, rather I keep looking around at the other stuff.', '2009-11-09 07:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719929, 830228, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is nice and stands out because it''s different from most of the other shots.<br/> <br/>I like the whole feel of this image, everything in it, including the power lines and bollards add to this nicely. Each object tells a little bit more about the story of this structure and the sky finishes it off nicely.</td>', 'This is nice and stands out because it''s different from most of the other shots. I like the whole feel of this image, everything in it, including the power lines and bollards add to this nicely. Each object tells a little bit more about the story of this structure and the sky finishes it off nicely.', '2009-11-09 07:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719931, 832390, 101117, '<td valign="top">Cool macro with really interesting colours. I do find though that the really strong yellow on the left hand side is competing for attention with the focused part of the image.</td>', 'Cool macro with really interesting colours. I do find though that the really strong yellow on the left hand side is competing for attention with the focused part of the image.', '2009-11-09 07:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719932, 829828, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice picturesque scene with good colours. I like the light on the far side of the water, I think without that this shot wouldn''t be nearly as nice to look at.</td>', 'Nice picturesque scene with good colours. I like the light on the far side of the water, I think without that this shot wouldn''t be nearly as nice to look at.', '2009-11-09 07:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719942, 832243, 101117, '<td valign="top">When I was browsing over all the shots in the challenge earlier, this was one of the few that really caught my eye.<br/> <br/>You have it all here, a great mood, a wonderful picturesque scene with great colours and the path leading off into the distance giving the shot some direction and focus. My bet would be that this one will do well.</td>', 'When I was browsing over all the shots in the challenge earlier, this was one of the few that really caught my eye. You have it all here, a great mood, a wonderful picturesque scene with great colours and the path leading off into the distance giving the shot some direction and focus. My bet would be that this one will do well.', '2009-11-09 07:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719946, 832566, 101117, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge. I''m not sure I like the overall softness here, I get that it was intentional, but I don''t think it fits the message you are conveying with the title.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge. I''m not sure I like the overall softness here, I get that it was intentional, but I don''t think it fits the message you are conveying with the title.', '2009-11-09 07:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719949, 831719, 101117, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a little harsh here and the subjects feel a touch out of focus.</td>', 'Lighting is a little harsh here and the subjects feel a touch out of focus.', '2009-11-09 07:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719951, 832539, 101117, '<td valign="top">You have two potentially interesting subjects here, unfortunately you have chosen to have both partially out of the shot. I would have liked to see more of this scene, perhaps the whole church with the tree hanging over or vice versa.</td>', 'You have two potentially interesting subjects here, unfortunately you have chosen to have both partially out of the shot. I would have liked to see more of this scene, perhaps the whole church with the tree hanging over or vice versa.', '2009-11-09 07:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719953, 831632, 101117, '<td valign="top">Not entirely sure where you were going with this one. I get the non centred framing but your subject is actually cut off by the bottom of the frame. Lighting is also a touch harsh making it hard to discern the details.</td>', 'Not entirely sure where you were going with this one. I get the non centred framing but your subject is actually cut off by the bottom of the frame. Lighting is also a touch harsh making it hard to discern the details.', '2009-11-09 07:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719959, 832292, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great details, I''ll bet this would have looked even better at full res!</td>', 'Great details, I''ll bet this would have looked even better at full res!', '2009-11-09 07:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719960, 828836, 101117, '<td valign="top">Really nice colours and lighting. I like the way you have filled the frame with the tree.</td>', 'Really nice colours and lighting. I like the way you have filled the frame with the tree.', '2009-11-09 07:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719963, 832398, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, especially that bright red one in the centre. I like the subtle reflections as well.<br/> <br/>Not overly keen on the angle you have taken this at, I always find shots at this sort of 45 degree angle make me want to see more at the far end.</td>', 'Nice colours, especially that bright red one in the centre. I like the subtle reflections as well. Not overly keen on the angle you have taken this at, I always find shots at this sort of 45 degree angle make me want to see more at the far end.', '2009-11-09 07:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719964, 830083, 101117, '<td valign="top">Really nice and colourful. I particularly like the sense you get with this shot of repeating patterns and the way your eye is led from the bottom all the way up to the top.</td>', 'Really nice and colourful. I particularly like the sense you get with this shot of repeating patterns and the way your eye is led from the bottom all the way up to the top.', '2009-11-09 07:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719965, 832623, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice detailed macro, though I''m not particularly keen on the framing. I don''t think the partially shadowed leaf adds anything here, and the well lit one is cut off half way.</td>', 'Nice detailed macro, though I''m not particularly keen on the framing. I don''t think the partially shadowed leaf adds anything here, and the well lit one is cut off half way.', '2009-11-09 07:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719967, 832581, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice country side feel to this shot. It has a great early morning cold look, reminds me of being back home in Scotland!</td>', 'Nice country side feel to this shot. It has a great early morning cold look, reminds me of being back home in Scotland!', '2009-11-09 07:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719968, 831229, 101117, '<td valign="top">What a great capture, love all the detail you have managed to get on the little guy sitting amongst all those leaves that dwarf him in comparison!</td>', 'What a great capture, love all the detail you have managed to get on the little guy sitting amongst all those leaves that dwarf him in comparison!', '2009-11-09 07:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719969, 832070, 101117, '<td valign="top">This shot is a bit messy. There''s no real subject to settle on and all the colours just seem to blend together.</td>', 'This shot is a bit messy. There''s no real subject to settle on and all the colours just seem to blend together.', '2009-11-09 07:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719971, 831867, 101117, '<td valign="top">That red strip across the upper third of the shot is a bit odd. It looks more like a lava flow than a sunset and I''m thinking you may have added that to try to enhance the sunset.</td>', 'That red strip across the upper third of the shot is a bit odd. It looks more like a lava flow than a sunset and I''m thinking you may have added that to try to enhance the sunset.', '2009-11-09 07:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719974, 832138, 101117, '<td valign="top">I love all the different colours here, particularly the strong red ones in the upper section. There is a slight lack of subject, it doesn''t hurt the shot too much as you do have the sky which gives a bit of an escape.</td>', 'I love all the different colours here, particularly the strong red ones in the upper section. There is a slight lack of subject, it doesn''t hurt the shot too much as you do have the sky which gives a bit of an escape.', '2009-11-09 07:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719986, 832560, 101117, '<td valign="top">You have the dubious honour of being my 1000th comment, so I chose your shot as it reminds me a lot of my home in Scotland :)<br/> <br/>I love the colours here, you have managed to capture some really nice strong reds and yellows. I also like the way that the ripples in the reflection actually makes it look a bit like fire, which has taken it away from being just another reflection shot and turned it into something far more interesting. <br/> <br/>I''m actually undecided whether I like the water part or the land part more! I''m glad you chose not to go with the long exposure on the water like so many other shots do.<br/> <br/>The lighting is also very nice, it has given the whole scene a warm feeling to it, while being subtle and not creating any harsh shadows.<br/> <br/>On the down side, the composition feels a little closed. The hill on the far side of the water looks really interesting, I find my eye drawn to the top of the frame wishing I could see more. I would have liked wider on the water too, I think again because it''s such an interesting part of the shot to look at, I find myself wanting to see more.<br/> <br/>Overall, a great shot, and one that really appeals to me!</td>', 'You have the dubious honour of being my 1000th comment, so I chose your shot as it reminds me a lot of my home in Scotland :) I love the colours here, you have managed to capture some really nice strong reds and yellows. I also like the way that the ripples in the reflection actually makes it look a bit like fire, which has taken it away from being just another reflection shot and turned it into something far more interesting.  I''m actually undecided whether I like the water part or the land part more! I''m glad you chose not to go with the long exposure on the water like so many other shots do. The lighting is also very nice, it has given the whole scene a warm feeling to it, while being subtle and not creating any harsh shadows. On the down side, the composition feels a little closed. The hill on the far side of the water looks really interesting, I find my eye drawn to the top of the frame wishing I could see more. I would have liked wider on the water too, I think again because it''s such an interesting part of the shot to look at, I find myself wanting to see more. Overall, a great shot, and one that really appeals to me!', '2009-11-09 07:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719987, 830980, 99710, '<td valign="top">my attention is drawn to the beautiful waterfalls and nothing else.</td>', 'my attention is drawn to the beautiful waterfalls and nothing else.', '2009-11-09 07:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719988, 830269, 99710, '<td valign="top">wow, beautiful. the colors are amazing. the water falls serves as good accent, i wish there were clouds though. but still a good strong image.</td>', 'wow, beautiful. the colors are amazing. the water falls serves as good accent, i wish there were clouds though. but still a good strong image.', '2009-11-09 07:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
