(5721552, 830549, 47470, '<td valign="top">It looks like the sun is still pretty high in the sky.  If you waited a little longer, just until when the light turns gold, it would have painted the buildings to match the foliage and made the scene look more like autumn, IMO.</td>', 'It looks like the sun is still pretty high in the sky.  If you waited a little longer, just until when the light turns gold, it would have painted the buildings to match the foliage and made the scene look more like autumn, IMO.', '2009-11-10 11:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5721553, 832581, 47470, '<td valign="top">The brightness of the sky and sky''s reflection compete for attention with the horse.  i think that if you brought the sky andthe reflection down in tone, it would have placed more focus on the horse.</td>', 'The brightness of the sky and sky''s reflection compete for attention with the horse.  i think that if you brought the sky andthe reflection down in tone, it would have placed more focus on the horse.', '2009-11-10 11:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5721554, 831160, 47470, '<td valign="top">I love the color, but wish there was the slightest bit more contrast, just to bring out the detail in the treetops.</td>', 'I love the color, but wish there was the slightest bit more contrast, just to bring out the detail in the treetops.', '2009-11-10 11:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5721555, 832413, 47470, '<td valign="top">With all the objects stuffed in the bottom of the frame, this looks more like a Tuscan Skyscape : )  The sky is very pretty, but I think it takes too much attention away from the land.  Maybe tilt the camera down more or crop out some sky?</td>', 'With all the objects stuffed in the bottom of the frame, this looks more like a Tuscan Skyscape : )  The sky is very pretty, but I think it takes too much attention away from the land.  Maybe tilt the camera down more or crop out some sky?', '2009-11-10 11:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5721562, 832291, 47470, '<td valign="top">I love the blanket of color on the floor, but I can''t help but wish there was something else to help anchor my eye.  My eyes follow the path, but at the end, there''s nothing to hold me there.</td>', 'I love the blanket of color on the floor, but I can''t help but wish there was something else to help anchor my eye.  My eyes follow the path, but at the end, there''s nothing to hold me there.', '2009-11-10 11:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5721563, 829024, 47470, '<td valign="top">I think the bright spots in the sky are a little distracting.  Cropping them out lets the river lead the eye to the bridge.</td>', 'I think the bright spots in the sky are a little distracting.  Cropping them out lets the river lead the eye to the bridge.', '2009-11-10 11:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5721565, 831789, 47470, '<td valign="top">Placing the horizon in the center makes the image to symmetrical, which places equal weight on the top and bottom halves of the image, which confuses the eye as to what it should be focusing on.  Maybe crop out half of the reflection?<br/> <br/>Also, I know the HDR brought out a lot of detail in the shadow areas, but it also made the overall image flat and grey.  Maybe throw on a little more contrast to pump everything back up?</td>', 'Placing the horizon in the center makes the image to symmetrical, which places equal weight on the top and bottom halves of the image, which confuses the eye as to what it should be focusing on.  Maybe crop out half of the reflection? Also, I know the HDR brought out a lot of detail in the shadow areas, but it also made the overall image flat and grey.  Maybe throw on a little more contrast to pump everything back up?', '2009-11-10 11:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5721568, 831180, 47470, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what the wreath is hanging on.  At first, I thought it was a car, in which case I would have wanted to see the car, but now it looks like a vent on a house, which I don''t want to see.  If it''s a vent, maybe you could use a shallower depth of field to blur the background so the lines are texture instead of something that makes the viewer wonder what everything is behind it.</td>', 'I''m not sure what the wreath is hanging on.  At first, I thought it was a car, in which case I would have wanted to see the car, but now it looks like a vent on a house, which I don''t want to see.  If it''s a vent, maybe you could use a shallower depth of field to blur the background so the lines are texture instead of something that makes the viewer wonder what everything is behind it.', '2009-11-10 11:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5721570, 829546, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish this wasn''t cropped so tight so I could have more context on the scene.  A slightly longer shutter speed would have blurred the water, leaving the bulk of the texture in the leaves, which are the topic of the challenge (as opposed to water).</td>', 'I wish this wasn''t cropped so tight so I could have more context on the scene.  A slightly longer shutter speed would have blurred the water, leaving the bulk of the texture in the leaves, which are the topic of the challenge (as opposed to water).', '2009-11-10 11:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5721572, 832601, 67152, '<td valign="top">splendid light - among my favorites</td>', 'splendid light - among my favorites', '2009-11-10 11:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5721576, 832623, 67152, '<td valign="top">i love the up close approach so we can feel, hear, and smell the maple leaves.  It just seems that the left side of the image is a bit too dark compared to the rest of the image and seems to steal some from ''the fire'' theme.</td>', 'i love the up close approach so we can feel, hear, and smell the maple leaves.  It just seems that the left side of the image is a bit too dark compared to the rest of the image and seems to steal some from ''the fire'' theme.', '2009-11-10 11:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5721577, 831867, 47470, '<td valign="top">The color, especially in the sky, looks unnaturally oversaturated.  Oversaturation also pulls out a lot of detail once the colors start becoming out-of-gamut.</td>', 'The color, especially in the sky, looks unnaturally oversaturated.  Oversaturation also pulls out a lot of detail once the colors start becoming out-of-gamut.', '2009-11-10 11:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
