(5721855, 830954, 67152, '<td valign="top">incorporating the complexity and interaction of the lily pads, the leaves and the sky and clouds makes this something to ponder and revisit - nicely done</td>', 'incorporating the complexity and interaction of the lily pads, the leaves and the sky and clouds makes this something to ponder and revisit - nicely done', '2009-11-10 15:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5721857, 832324, 67152, '<td valign="top">a classic battle - the intensity of color of fall and the bleakness of winter<br/> <br/> <br/>on the border - i really think it does the photo no benefit and actually dilutes from the starkness of the grays and the reds</td>', 'a classic battle - the intensity of color of fall and the bleakness of winter  on the border - i really think it does the photo no benefit and actually dilutes from the starkness of the grays and the reds', '2009-11-10 15:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5721862, 832243, 74911, '<td valign="top">This is brilliant. Everything is cool about this image. Composition, processing, lighting, sharpness and ofcourse colors. I have lived in Illinois for over 3 years (in Bloomington). Eager to see which place this is.<br/> <br/>Good luck.<br/> <br/>Raj</td>', 'This is brilliant. Everything is cool about this image. Composition, processing, lighting, sharpness and ofcourse colors. I have lived in Illinois for over 3 years (in Bloomington). Eager to see which place this is. Good luck. Raj', '2009-11-10 15:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5721865, 832560, 67152, '<td valign="top">glorious in the simplicity of the scene - the arches provide a much needed break to the colors and aids the transitions from yellow to orange to red</td>', 'glorious in the simplicity of the scene - the arches provide a much needed break to the colors and aids the transitions from yellow to orange to red', '2009-11-10 15:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5721869, 832032, 67152, '<td valign="top">an intense and interesting abstract - i just can''s see the forest for the trees in this.  no vote as I don''t understand - although I do appreciate it for the image it is and the interaction of shapes, colors, and layers</td>', 'an intense and interesting abstract - i just can''s see the forest for the trees in this.  no vote as I don''t understand - although I do appreciate it for the image it is and the interaction of shapes, colors, and layers', '2009-11-10 15:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5721870, 829024, 67152, '<td valign="top">wonderful landscape - the colors so intense, the scene so quiet</td>', 'wonderful landscape - the colors so intense, the scene so quiet', '2009-11-10 15:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
