(5722051, 830306, 47470, '<td valign="top">Your blacks are tinted pretty far into the blue, which counters the warm tons of the leaves.  I can''t tell if I like it or not.  The blue kinda makes sense since fall is actually quite cold, but it also makes the photo look somehow unnatural.</td>', 'Your blacks are tinted pretty far into the blue, which counters the warm tons of the leaves.  I can''t tell if I like it or not.  The blue kinda makes sense since fall is actually quite cold, but it also makes the photo look somehow unnatural.', '2009-11-10 19:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
