(5722630, 832630, 47470, '<td valign="top">Very unique perspective with great leading lines.  It looks like there might be a little bit of detail loss (out of gamut colors from oversaturation) in the trees by the right hanging cable, but that''s a little nit-picky.  Great shot!</td>', 'Very unique perspective with great leading lines.  It looks like there might be a little bit of detail loss (out of gamut colors from oversaturation) in the trees by the right hanging cable, but that''s a little nit-picky.  Great shot!', '2009-11-11 02:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5722638, 831701, 47470, '<td valign="top">Incredible detail in the stump!  The colors are perfect: brown, yet bright and not oversaturated!  I might have added a little bit of a vignette, but other than that, great shot!</td>', 'Incredible detail in the stump!  The colors are perfect: brown, yet bright and not oversaturated!  I might have added a little bit of a vignette, but other than that, great shot!', '2009-11-11 02:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5722642, 830064, 47470, '<td valign="top">Such cool looking trees, but I don''t really like your border.  Just saying, not knocking you down for it.</td>', 'Such cool looking trees, but I don''t really like your border.  Just saying, not knocking you down for it.', '2009-11-11 02:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5722646, 831641, 47470, '<td valign="top">The clouds and the mood are so beautiful, but I think the tilt distracts from it.  I love the muted colors.</td>', 'The clouds and the mood are so beautiful, but I think the tilt distracts from it.  I love the muted colors.', '2009-11-11 02:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5722649, 830085, 47470, '<td valign="top">Good balance between tones and great composition.  I wish there was the slightest bit more highlight on the log.  I love that you choose to shoot with the water flowing away from you and towards the sun since almost everyone shoots with the water coming towards them.</td>', 'Good balance between tones and great composition.  I wish there was the slightest bit more highlight on the log.  I love that you choose to shoot with the water flowing away from you and towards the sun since almost everyone shoots with the water coming towards them.', '2009-11-11 02:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5722650, 828914, 47470, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for beautiful bokeh.  They create such pretty detail in the background.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for beautiful bokeh.  They create such pretty detail in the background.', '2009-11-11 02:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5722651, 829330, 47470, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  I like that the colors of the background are opposite of the colors of the subject.</td>', 'Great idea!  I like that the colors of the background are opposite of the colors of the subject.', '2009-11-11 02:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5722653, 832022, 47470, '<td valign="top">Some motion blur on the swing would had added the most perfect nostalgic touch.</td>', 'Some motion blur on the swing would had added the most perfect nostalgic touch.', '2009-11-11 02:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5722655, 830538, 47470, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tones.  I love the soft focus.</td>', 'Beautiful tones.  I love the soft focus.', '2009-11-11 02:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5722660, 832430, 47470, '<td valign="top">I think I might have cropped the slightest bit from the left, but this is a great image.  That dog looks like the perfect hiking companion.</td>', 'I think I might have cropped the slightest bit from the left, but this is a great image.  That dog looks like the perfect hiking companion.', '2009-11-11 02:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5722661, 830228, 47470, '<td valign="top">This looks like HDR, but luckily, it''s not too overdone to make it grey and dull; the colors are still nice and bright!  The building looks very beautiful, old, and calm, but the distortion gives off a feeling of strength and arrogance, which I think doesn''t work with this particular building.  Maybe try a longer lens (the reflection in the windows make me think you had plenty of room to back up) or a tilt-shift lens?  The reflections in the windows are gorgeous, by the way, especially the inclusion of the flag.</td>', 'This looks like HDR, but luckily, it''s not too overdone to make it grey and dull; the colors are still nice and bright!  The building looks very beautiful, old, and calm, but the distortion gives off a feeling of strength and arrogance, which I think doesn''t work with this particular building.  Maybe try a longer lens (the reflection in the windows make me think you had plenty of room to back up) or a tilt-shift lens?  The reflections in the windows are gorgeous, by the way, especially the inclusion of the flag.', '2009-11-11 02:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5722666, 830384, 47470, '<td valign="top">I can''t decide if I prefer this with the car or without.  Without it, this would look like most of the other literal interpretation in the challenge, but the truck of the car still seems somehow out of place.  I also find it interesting that you chose to use the back end of the car (or at least it looks like it to me!) instead of the front.</td>', 'I can''t decide if I prefer this with the car or without.  Without it, this would look like most of the other literal interpretation in the challenge, but the truck of the car still seems somehow out of place.  I also find it interesting that you chose to use the back end of the car (or at least it looks like it to me!) instead of the front.', '2009-11-11 02:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5722667, 832496, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish you yellows had the slightest bit more red in them so that they would look more gold (slightly orange instead of slightly green).</td>', 'I wish you yellows had the slightest bit more red in them so that they would look more gold (slightly orange instead of slightly green).', '2009-11-11 02:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5722668, 831729, 47470, '<td valign="top">I love the texture of the log!  The green fern complements it nicely, but I would have preferred only one red leaf on the right and none on the left.  The way it is now gives too many kinds of texture for my liking, so I think I would have preferred something a little more simple.</td>', 'I love the texture of the log!  The green fern complements it nicely, but I would have preferred only one red leaf on the right and none on the left.  The way it is now gives too many kinds of texture for my liking, so I think I would have preferred something a little more simple.', '2009-11-11 02:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5722669, 831113, 47470, '<td valign="top">I keep wanting to tilt my head to the left to straighten the tables.  If I draw an imaginary line from the table to the ground, they look straight, but the tilted tabletops still make me want to rotate the image a little clockwise.</td>', 'I keep wanting to tilt my head to the left to straighten the tables.  If I draw an imaginary line from the table to the ground, they look straight, but the tilted tabletops still make me want to rotate the image a little clockwise.', '2009-11-11 02:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5722676, 830100, 47470, '<td valign="top">This looks like such a great location.  The detail and soft color of the grasses look like the perfect place to stick a delicate model!<br/> <br/>I wonder what this would look like if your camera was a little closer to the ground so that the leading lines of the bottom of the treetops didn''t form a straight line.</td>', 'This looks like such a great location.  The detail and soft color of the grasses look like the perfect place to stick a delicate model! I wonder what this would look like if your camera was a little closer to the ground so that the leading lines of the bottom of the treetops didn''t form a straight line.', '2009-11-11 02:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5722678, 832111, 47470, '<td valign="top">I think I would have angled the leaves differently or cut off their stems.  The stems are like leading lines, but they don''t lead your eye to anything, which is particularly distracting considering how soft and curved the rest of the image is.</td>', 'I think I would have angled the leaves differently or cut off their stems.  The stems are like leading lines, but they don''t lead your eye to anything, which is particularly distracting considering how soft and curved the rest of the image is.', '2009-11-11 02:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5722683, 831836, 47470, '<td valign="top">I might have used the hue slider (or something similar) to bring the yellows of the trees closer to the reds/oranges than the greens.</td>', 'I might have used the hue slider (or something similar) to bring the yellows of the trees closer to the reds/oranges than the greens.', '2009-11-11 02:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5722685, 832370, 47470, '<td valign="top">The sky is a bit bright on the horizon for my taste, but the soft gold light on the path is  very beautiful.</td>', 'The sky is a bit bright on the horizon for my taste, but the soft gold light on the path is  very beautiful.', '2009-11-11 02:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5722695, 832566, 47470, '<td valign="top">It took me a minute to realize that this is a dress hanging on a tree, not a bride in a strange position that hid the arms and head.  I know that these types of images are very popular in wedding photography, but it still seems like a strange place to stick the dress.  Besides the weird context, this is a very pretty image.</td>', 'It took me a minute to realize that this is a dress hanging on a tree, not a bride in a strange position that hid the arms and head.  I know that these types of images are very popular in wedding photography, but it still seems like a strange place to stick the dress.  Besides the weird context, this is a very pretty image.', '2009-11-11 03:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
