(5724282, 830826, 44611, '<td valign="top">Nice shadows and good autumn colours.</td>', 'Nice shadows and good autumn colours.', '2009-11-12 10:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724283, 830062, 44611, '<td valign="top">Stunning shot - lovely colours and light.</td>', 'Stunning shot - lovely colours and light.', '2009-11-12 10:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724285, 829208, 44611, '<td valign="top">A lovely scene and good autumn colour.</td>', 'A lovely scene and good autumn colour.', '2009-11-12 10:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724286, 831701, 44611, '<td valign="top">Beautifully sharp and a different approach including the fungi.  Great shot.</td>', 'Beautifully sharp and a different approach including the fungi.  Great shot.', '2009-11-12 10:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724287, 830083, 44611, '<td valign="top">Love the carpet of leaves .. good angle.</td>', 'Love the carpet of leaves .. good angle.', '2009-11-12 10:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724288, 832407, 44611, '<td valign="top">Love this abstract although I''m not personally keen on the frame for this shot with the tree trunks disappearing into it.</td>', 'Love this abstract although I''m not personally keen on the frame for this shot with the tree trunks disappearing into it.', '2009-11-12 10:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724289, 829529, 44611, '<td valign="top">Great autumn colours and an interesting abstract.</td>', 'Great autumn colours and an interesting abstract.', '2009-11-12 10:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724290, 832534, 44611, '<td valign="top">I just knew there would be deer shots in this challenge! Congrates on catching all three looking at you.</td>', 'I just knew there would be deer shots in this challenge! Congrates on catching all three looking at you.', '2009-11-12 10:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724291, 832022, 44611, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful tree. A lovely shot although the horizon is a bit off I think.</td>', 'What a beautiful tree. A lovely shot although the horizon is a bit off I think.', '2009-11-12 10:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724292, 832398, 44611, '<td valign="top">Such a shame here that the reflections weren''t stronger.  A lovely waterside view though.</td>', 'Such a shame here that the reflections weren''t stronger.  A lovely waterside view though.', '2009-11-12 10:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724293, 832243, 44611, '<td valign="top">Fabulous colours and love that you''ve got a patch of sunlight in there.</td>', 'Fabulous colours and love that you''ve got a patch of sunlight in there.', '2009-11-12 10:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724294, 831729, 44611, '<td valign="top">Really like the contrast between the green bracken and the autumnal leaves.  Nice and sharp too.</td>', 'Really like the contrast between the green bracken and the autumnal leaves.  Nice and sharp too.', '2009-11-12 10:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724295, 832498, 44611, '<td valign="top">Great carpet of leaves.  Whatever is in the background is a bit distracting though.</td>', 'Great carpet of leaves.  Whatever is in the background is a bit distracting though.', '2009-11-12 10:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724298, 831861, 56978, '<td valign="top">I''m sure there''s a great shot in here somewhere, but unfortunately I can''t really see it...I''m intrigued to know what that creature is though!</td>', 'I''m sure there''s a great shot in here somewhere, but unfortunately I can''t really see it...I''m intrigued to know what that creature is though!', '2009-11-12 10:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724373, 829024, 104841, '<td valign="top">really nice shot but for some reason I feel as if the shot is not level.</td>', 'really nice shot but for some reason I feel as if the shot is not level.', '2009-11-12 12:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724374, 831641, 104841, '<td valign="top">I really like the angle and scene, but the post precessing has left the shot down. maybe if the reds did not stand out so much.</td>', 'I really like the angle and scene, but the post precessing has left the shot down. maybe if the reds did not stand out so much.', '2009-11-12 12:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724377, 832303, 104841, '<td valign="top">This looks like a really nice location. The foreground appears to be a little overexposed though. If I was taking this shot I would have gotten down low near the pool of water.</td>', 'This looks like a really nice location. The foreground appears to be a little overexposed though. If I was taking this shot I would have gotten down low near the pool of water.', '2009-11-12 12:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724379, 829086, 104841, '<td valign="top">yay I nice spring shot! I would have tried to clean up the composition though.</td>', 'yay I nice spring shot! I would have tried to clean up the composition though.', '2009-11-12 12:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724382, 830085, 104841, '<td valign="top">really nice shot, it appears that shooting into the sun is all the rage now days. I would have placed some more leaves on the log though or reflected some more light onto it.</td>', 'really nice shot, it appears that shooting into the sun is all the rage now days. I would have placed some more leaves on the log though or reflected some more light onto it.', '2009-11-12 12:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724389, 832077, 104841, '<td valign="top">really nice idea. I think that the top middle needs a leaf up there too, also a polariser might cut down the reflected sky.</td>', 'really nice idea. I think that the top middle needs a leaf up there too, also a polariser might cut down the reflected sky.', '2009-11-12 12:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724404, 831705, 104841, '<td valign="top">I am sorry but I don''t agree with your chose of foreground, esp when its hiding such a great back ground. I would have tried to find something else that did not block out the rest of the shot, like a nice rock or small bush.</td>', 'I am sorry but I don''t agree with your chose of foreground, esp when its hiding such a great back ground. I would have tried to find something else that did not block out the rest of the shot, like a nice rock or small bush.', '2009-11-12 12:37:02.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5724407, 831516, 104841, '<td valign="top">I really like the reflections, but don''t really like the fence at the bottom, maybe it should have been cropped out.</td>', 'I really like the reflections, but don''t really like the fence at the bottom, maybe it should have been cropped out.', '2009-11-12 12:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724429, 832404, 69368, '<td valign="top">oh, Korfu! I went there in September...<br/> <br/>at the second view I noticed it isn''t Korfu... nice picture at anyway</td>', 'oh, Korfu! I went there in September... at the second view I noticed it isn''t Korfu... nice picture at anyway', '2009-11-12 13:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724466, 832292, 69368, '<td valign="top">nice textures here</td>', 'nice textures here', '2009-11-12 13:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724589, 831642, 45631, '<td valign="top">The subject it Foliage, so probably the wrong challenge to shoe-horn this into.  Nice image but scored low.</td>', 'The subject it Foliage, so probably the wrong challenge to shoe-horn this into.  Nice image but scored low.', '2009-11-12 16:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724595, 831867, 45631, '<td valign="top">I don''t find that this image meets the challenge.  Comes across as a landscape with the sun setting, not an image whos subject is foliage.</td>', 'I don''t find that this image meets the challenge.  Comes across as a landscape with the sun setting, not an image whos subject is foliage.', '2009-11-12 16:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724607, 832540, 44786, '<td valign="top">This is great image, has inspired me to try to make similar photo of my son in the weekend.</td>', 'This is great image, has inspired me to try to make similar photo of my son in the weekend.', '2009-11-12 16:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724610, 831629, 44786, '<td valign="top">OK this photo does not "Celebrate fall and the COLORS that come with it", think its the only BW in the challenge, but I just love the composition and the textures. One of the best in the challenge IMO,</td>', 'OK this photo does not "Celebrate fall and the COLORS that come with it", think its the only BW in the challenge, but I just love the composition and the textures. One of the best in the challenge IMO,', '2009-11-12 16:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724718, 832631, 97814, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo!</td>', 'Beautiful photo!', '2009-11-12 18:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724720, 830215, 97814, '<td valign="top">Oh yea - great photo!</td>', 'Oh yea - great photo!', '2009-11-12 18:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724721, 829600, 97814, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo!</td>', 'Beautiful photo!', '2009-11-12 18:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724722, 829196, 99263, '<td valign="top">Hmmmmm.... a little bland and without impact.</td>', 'Hmmmmm.... a little bland and without impact.', '2009-11-12 18:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724724, 831627, 99263, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition with nice autumn colors and good detail.</td>', 'Lovely composition with nice autumn colors and good detail.', '2009-11-12 18:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724726, 831701, 97814, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2009-11-12 18:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724727, 830968, 97814, '<td valign="top">Very Nice!</td>', 'Very Nice!', '2009-11-12 18:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724740, 831859, 99263, '<td valign="top">Lovely close up of the forest floor with nice detail and strong color in the leaves.</td>', 'Lovely close up of the forest floor with nice detail and strong color in the leaves.', '2009-11-12 18:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724746, 832243, 97814, '<td valign="top">Stunning photo 10</td>', 'Stunning photo 10', '2009-11-12 18:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724753, 828853, 99263, '<td valign="top">Simple, yet with lots of appeal and visual impact. Nice bokeh and the holes in the leave add extra interest.</td>', 'Simple, yet with lots of appeal and visual impact. Nice bokeh and the holes in the leave add extra interest.', '2009-11-12 18:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724758, 832070, 99263, '<td valign="top">Lovely fine detail in the foliage but I find the colors a little too muted and there is a lack of depth in the image.</td>', 'Lovely fine detail in the foliage but I find the colors a little too muted and there is a lack of depth in the image.', '2009-11-12 18:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724760, 832399, 99263, '<td valign="top">Nicely detailed close up with good strong autumn browns.</td>', 'Nicely detailed close up with good strong autumn browns.', '2009-11-12 18:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724767, 829774, 99263, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple with lovely bokeh,good strong autumn colors and fine detail.</td>', 'Nice and simple with lovely bokeh,good strong autumn colors and fine detail.', '2009-11-12 18:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724814, 830215, 111808, '<td valign="top">What a handsome fellow admiring that other handsome fellow in the water. I like the autumn reflections in this - it gives the photograph a sense of timelessness without specific reference.</td>', 'What a handsome fellow admiring that other handsome fellow in the water. I like the autumn reflections in this - it gives the photograph a sense of timelessness without specific reference.', '2009-11-12 20:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724815, 832633, 111808, '<td valign="top">November is a cold month, well past the brilliance of October. I like the concept of this, however I would like to see more brilliant saturation even in the detritus of the leaves &amp; ground cover.</td>', 'November is a cold month, well past the brilliance of October. I like the concept of this, however I would like to see more brilliant saturation even in the detritus of the leaves & ground cover.', '2009-11-12 20:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724818, 832490, 111808, '<td valign="top">The leaves here are on so many levels that it almost looks surreal. I like that aspect of it, however the specular highlights of the water are a bit distracting. The mid-lower quadrant leaves are the most crisp &amp; it captures the chaotic moving season that is Fall quite well.</td>', 'The leaves here are on so many levels that it almost looks surreal. I like that aspect of it, however the specular highlights of the water are a bit distracting. The mid-lower quadrant leaves are the most crisp & it captures the chaotic moving season that is Fall quite well.', '2009-11-12 20:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724823, 832407, 111808, '<td valign="top">I like the abstract almost brush-like texture which composes this shot. The brilliant golds &amp; oranges contrast nicely with the dark black of the trunks. Fall has a most definite sense of movement here, well done.</td>', 'I like the abstract almost brush-like texture which composes this shot. The brilliant golds & oranges contrast nicely with the dark black of the trunks. Fall has a most definite sense of movement here, well done.', '2009-11-12 20:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724826, 832283, 111808, '<td valign="top">I love the individual autumnal mini mosaic pieces in this macro leaf forming a cohesive whole. The colour shifts are nice from the gold to the rust red-brown to bits of still holding one summer green. Very nice microcosm indeed.</td>', 'I love the individual autumnal mini mosaic pieces in this macro leaf forming a cohesive whole. The colour shifts are nice from the gold to the rust red-brown to bits of still holding one summer green. Very nice microcosm indeed.', '2009-11-12 20:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724833, 829121, 111808, '<td valign="top">I like how the late autumn sunlight is casting elongated shadows on the quiet cemetery - almost like a quiet reminder of a shortening sense of time paralleling the individual mortality of the photoseeker as well. I like how the darker canopy of tree foliage is holding down the light to the centre essence. All too soon the sunset light will be lost.</td>', 'I like how the late autumn sunlight is casting elongated shadows on the quiet cemetery - almost like a quiet reminder of a shortening sense of time paralleling the individual mortality of the photoseeker as well. I like how the darker canopy of tree foliage is holding down the light to the centre essence. All too soon the sunset light will be lost.', '2009-11-12 20:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724839, 830100, 111808, '<td valign="top">There is a sense of autumnal symmetry in this photo, and the lines draw one in. The field is almost pastoral &amp; contrasts nicely with the blazing orange-red colours. The sky is grey however &amp; hints at your title. Snow is coming &amp; is probably not far off but there is peace in the overlap of seasons.</td>', 'There is a sense of autumnal symmetry in this photo, and the lines draw one in. The field is almost pastoral & contrasts nicely with the blazing orange-red colours. The sky is grey however & hints at your title. Snow is coming & is probably not far off but there is peace in the overlap of seasons.', '2009-11-12 20:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724843, 832422, 111808, '<td valign="top">I love the wonderful colour blends in this photo - contrasts &amp; complements, distant highlights extending the scene. It is peaceful, even the darker storm clouds are only hints of a coming thunder which does not penetrate the veil - yet.</td>', 'I love the wonderful colour blends in this photo - contrasts & complements, distant highlights extending the scene. It is peaceful, even the darker storm clouds are only hints of a coming thunder which does not penetrate the veil - yet.', '2009-11-12 20:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724845, 832561, 111808, '<td valign="top">And the darker leaves are the leaded lines. I wish this wasn''t.. quite .. so dark however.</td>', 'And the darker leaves are the leaded lines. I wish this wasn''t.. quite .. so dark however.', '2009-11-12 20:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724848, 830240, 111808, '<td valign="top">This is just beautiful - the contrasts of the brilliance of the oranges &amp; reds with the well worn &amp; old greystone Celtic cross. Great definition in the tree &amp; the shadows. Another plus in the ground reflections &amp; the dapple on both the back tree &amp; the cross &amp; the shadow here parallels the leaves, reinforcing the mood of tranquility. One of my very favourites in this challenge.</td>', 'This is just beautiful - the contrasts of the brilliance of the oranges & reds with the well worn & old greystone Celtic cross. Great definition in the tree & the shadows. Another plus in the ground reflections & the dapple on both the back tree & the cross & the shadow here parallels the leaves, reinforcing the mood of tranquility. One of my very favourites in this challenge.', '2009-11-12 20:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724849, 831800, 100831, '<td valign="top">Ow how sweet. What a nice choice of dof to show off both the people and the autumn colors. Everything is just right.</td>', 'Ow how sweet. What a nice choice of dof to show off both the people and the autumn colors. Everything is just right.', '2009-11-12 20:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724850, 832324, 111808, '<td valign="top">The patterns and crinkles in the pale ice contrast nicely with the red of the leaf. Winter now has Autumn in her grasp &amp; will not give in lightly. This is simple, graphic and beautiful.</td>', 'The patterns and crinkles in the pale ice contrast nicely with the red of the leaf. Winter now has Autumn in her grasp & will not give in lightly. This is simple, graphic and beautiful.', '2009-11-12 20:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724851, 832620, 100831, '<td valign="top">It doesn''t need the fancy title because it''s such a lovely picture. Wonderful earthy colors, nice dof and composition. 7</td>', 'It doesn''t need the fancy title because it''s such a lovely picture. Wonderful earthy colors, nice dof and composition. 7', '2009-11-12 20:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724853, 832134, 100831, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective</td>', 'Nice perspective', '2009-11-12 20:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724854, 832063, 111808, '<td valign="top">The flow of the water is quite engaging - it is almost the same even grey tones as reflected in the sky.</td>', 'The flow of the water is quite engaging - it is almost the same even grey tones as reflected in the sky.', '2009-11-12 20:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724857, 830460, 100831, '<td valign="top">The green in the background is terrific as is the light in the middle. Everything floats - almost like an aquarium. I love abstracts. 8</td>', 'The green in the background is terrific as is the light in the middle. Everything floats - almost like an aquarium. I love abstracts. 8', '2009-11-12 20:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724858, 830968, 100831, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice idea. I''m not sure, but I think the curves tool could help bring up the darks just a slight bit. I like it though. 6</td>', 'This is a really nice idea. I''m not sure, but I think the curves tool could help bring up the darks just a slight bit. I like it though. 6', '2009-11-12 20:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724859, 832624, 100831, '<td valign="top">Fun? I think that''s better than Fun! I love the pink too against the the earth. Great dof. 8</td>', 'Fun? I think that''s better than Fun! I love the pink too against the the earth. Great dof. 8', '2009-11-12 20:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724862, 831094, 100831, '<td valign="top">What don''t I get here? (okay I''m talking to myself now) The colors are definitely right on. The composition is terrific. I guess I just don''t know if the motion works for me. I will come back and look again before I vote. You do get an A+ for different and I like different.</td>', 'What don''t I get here? (okay I''m talking to myself now) The colors are definitely right on. The composition is terrific. I guess I just don''t know if the motion works for me. I will come back and look again before I vote. You do get an A+ for different and I like different.', '2009-11-12 20:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724863, 831769, 111808, '<td valign="top">The wispy flow of the stream or waterfall at the top reinforces the twig on the right which then leads the eye to the leaves on the rock. These are brown and not brilliantly coloured anymore but they do represent that stage of Autumn where things go back to the Earth. All the elements are simple yet contained in this photograph, leading to a circle which flows harmoniously together. The viewing is a pleasure.</td>', 'The wispy flow of the stream or waterfall at the top reinforces the twig on the right which then leads the eye to the leaves on the rock. These are brown and not brilliantly coloured anymore but they do represent that stage of Autumn where things go back to the Earth. All the elements are simple yet contained in this photograph, leading to a circle which flows harmoniously together. The viewing is a pleasure.', '2009-11-12 20:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724864, 828430, 100831, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great idea. And if the lone leaf were bright red against the background, it would work better for me. I do like it though. 6</td>', 'I think this is a great idea. And if the lone leaf were bright red against the background, it would work better for me. I do like it though. 6', '2009-11-12 20:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724866, 832540, 100831, '<td valign="top">Somehow the blown highlights really work.</td>', 'Somehow the blown highlights really work.', '2009-11-12 20:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724867, 828705, 100831, '<td valign="top">I like the light on the fuzzy creature. Color is superb too.</td>', 'I like the light on the fuzzy creature. Color is superb too.', '2009-11-12 20:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724869, 832345, 100831, '<td valign="top">I think the fact that this is all bright makes this work really well. <br/>Nice idea. Nicely done.</td>', 'I think the fact that this is all bright makes this work really well. Nice idea. Nicely done.', '2009-11-12 20:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724870, 830124, 111808, '<td valign="top">The thin waterfall in the distance seems to be echoed by the roots of the foreground subject tree. That is the only source of any real colour - te rest of the tones are light &amp; dark, shadows &amp; greys. Very harmonious &amp; yet the diverse &amp; myriad shapes provide difference &amp; tension.</td>', 'The thin waterfall in the distance seems to be echoed by the roots of the foreground subject tree. That is the only source of any real colour - te rest of the tones are light & dark, shadows & greys. Very harmonious & yet the diverse & myriad shapes provide difference & tension.', '2009-11-12 20:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724871, 832498, 100831, '<td valign="top">Nice depth of field. Great perspective.</td>', 'Nice depth of field. Great perspective.', '2009-11-12 20:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724873, 829529, 111808, '<td valign="top">Great blends &amp; colour contrasts. Prometheus stole fire &amp; gave it to mankind &amp; these trees could be representative of that gift. He was severely punished by the Gods for his folly in doing so however sometimes there is great beauty in the abstract nature of Fall and unanticipated gifts. Tones are nice.</td>', 'Great blends & colour contrasts. Prometheus stole fire & gave it to mankind & these trees could be representative of that gift. He was severely punished by the Gods for his folly in doing so however sometimes there is great beauty in the abstract nature of Fall and unanticipated gifts. Tones are nice.', '2009-11-12 21:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724877, 832138, 111808, '<td valign="top">The uptop perspective on this is unusual &amp; quite engaging, the contrasts well blended, the exposure even &amp; balanced. The centre tree provides a nice focal point as well.</td>', 'The uptop perspective on this is unusual & quite engaging, the contrasts well blended, the exposure even & balanced. The centre tree provides a nice focal point as well.', '2009-11-12 21:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724881, 830083, 111808, '<td valign="top">This makes me want to walk along the path kicking up the thick carpet of leaves. This could be done for quite a while before encountering the guardians of the symmetrical Trees. The angle draws one in immediately &amp; the perspective is quite delightful.</td>', 'This makes me want to walk along the path kicking up the thick carpet of leaves. This could be done for quite a while before encountering the guardians of the symmetrical Trees. The angle draws one in immediately & the perspective is quite delightful.', '2009-11-12 21:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724884, 832628, 111808, '<td valign="top">The contrasts of the extreme red complementing the darker black &amp; white of the nicely flowing creek are absolutely gorgeous in this photograph. I like how the stones on the right side of the creek echo the waterflow &amp; enhance it.</td>', 'The contrasts of the extreme red complementing the darker black & white of the nicely flowing creek are absolutely gorgeous in this photograph. I like how the stones on the right side of the creek echo the waterflow & enhance it.', '2009-11-12 21:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724887, 829208, 111808, '<td valign="top">Brilliant colours, blending shades &amp; tones contrast nicely with the bridge providing just a hint of stability in all the change around it. This speaks well of Autumn. It is quite beautiful in the shapes &amp; lines.</td>', 'Brilliant colours, blending shades & tones contrast nicely with the bridge providing just a hint of stability in all the change around it. This speaks well of Autumn. It is quite beautiful in the shapes & lines.', '2009-11-12 21:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724891, 832364, 111808, '<td valign="top">One of the last vestiges, holding on...stark,graphic,simple &amp; I like the way the fragile twig holding it leads my eye in from the right to the slightly off centre leaf.</td>', 'One of the last vestiges, holding on...stark,graphic,simple & I like the way the fragile twig holding it leads my eye in from the right to the slightly off centre leaf.', '2009-11-12 21:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724896, 831506, 111808, '<td valign="top">This is so crisply done that every pore and line and pattern of leaf is visible and focused. The overlap adds another layer of slight shadows,tempering &amp; changing the colour. The diagonals are dynamically indicative of movement. This is a delightful photograph, one of my favourites.</td>', 'This is so crisply done that every pore and line and pattern of leaf is visible and focused. The overlap adds another layer of slight shadows,tempering & changing the colour. The diagonals are dynamically indicative of movement. This is a delightful photograph, one of my favourites.', '2009-11-12 21:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724904, 829501, 111808, '<td valign="top">This is superb - the saturated colours &amp; tones, dynamic off centre shapes &amp; simple reflective darkwater background make this one a winner. GREAT shot &amp; reflectively beautiful.</td>', 'This is superb - the saturated colours & tones, dynamic off centre shapes & simple reflective darkwater background make this one a winner. GREAT shot & reflectively beautiful.', '2009-11-12 21:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724970, 830062, 79357, '<td valign="top">a polarizer would have been a help here</td>', 'a polarizer would have been a help here', '2009-11-12 23:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5724973, 832405, 79357, '<td valign="top">compliments for "daring" not to oversaturate here on the can-never-be-too poppy DPC... ;-)</td>', 'compliments for "daring" not to oversaturate here on the can-never-be-too poppy DPC... ;-)', '2009-11-12 23:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5725176, 830826, 28564, '<td valign="top">try to eliminate the white (too white) sky here, and your photograph will be really better then now (imho)... i like the light very very much.</td>', 'try to eliminate the white (too white) sky here, and your photograph will be really better then now (imho)... i like the light very very much.', '2009-11-13 06:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
