(5725975, 832022, 17203, '<td valign="top">Ack! What were you thinking?!? There can be no excuse for finding a scene like this and not having a kid on the swing! You''ve got all the potential in the world for great color and composition, but without say, a little girl in a white dress, you lose any sense of emotional impact the joy and fun of the season, framed in brilliant leaves. I should give you a 1 and take off 3 more points on your next entry for such blatant negligence! You''ll have to settle for a 7.</td>', 'Ack! What were you thinking?!? There can be no excuse for finding a scene like this and not having a kid on the swing! You''ve got all the potential in the world for great color and composition, but without say, a little girl in a white dress, you lose any sense of emotional impact the joy and fun of the season, framed in brilliant leaves. I should give you a 1 and take off 3 more points on your next entry for such blatant negligence! You''ll have to settle for a 7.', '2009-11-13 21:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5725982, 832390, 107190, '<td valign="top">Great angle, unusual - I can feel the leaves</td>', 'Great angle, unusual - I can feel the leaves', '2009-11-13 21:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726128, 830469, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great landscape shot, almost has a painting like quality naturally.</td>', 'Great landscape shot, almost has a painting like quality naturally.', '2009-11-14 04:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726129, 829774, 101117, '<td valign="top">The background is superb here, not that the foreground isn''t nice too, but the background makes this shot through excellent control of DOF.</td>', 'The background is superb here, not that the foreground isn''t nice too, but the background makes this shot through excellent control of DOF.', '2009-11-14 04:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726130, 832092, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice calm scene. I like the way it drops off in a V shape, which creates a really interesting scene with the reflection.</td>', 'Nice calm scene. I like the way it drops off in a V shape, which creates a really interesting scene with the reflection.', '2009-11-14 04:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726131, 831769, 101117, '<td valign="top">Don''t really like the lighting here, I think you have some front on lighting which makes a lot of the shot feel very harsh, especially in the hanging branch.</td>', 'Don''t really like the lighting here, I think you have some front on lighting which makes a lot of the shot feel very harsh, especially in the hanging branch.', '2009-11-14 04:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726132, 832061, 101117, '<td valign="top">It really is very YELLOW! The whole shot is perhaps missing a bit of contrast because of all the yellowness.</td>', 'It really is very YELLOW! The whole shot is perhaps missing a bit of contrast because of all the yellowness.', '2009-11-14 04:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726133, 830419, 101117, '<td valign="top">I think the flat light has let you down a bit here. The scene is nice and you''ve taken it from an interesting angle, but I''m guessing you have a flat white sky there which has caused the shot to look a little flat too. <br/> <br/>I think it would be worth going back and retaking this shot when you have some direct sunlight to give the scene contrast and shadows.</td>', 'I think the flat light has let you down a bit here. The scene is nice and you''ve taken it from an interesting angle, but I''m guessing you have a flat white sky there which has caused the shot to look a little flat too.  I think it would be worth going back and retaking this shot when you have some direct sunlight to give the scene contrast and shadows.', '2009-11-14 04:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726158, 832407, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely effect, love the way each blurred line has a distinct end point... lovely texture.</td>', 'Lovely effect, love the way each blurred line has a distinct end point... lovely texture.', '2009-11-14 06:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726159, 830256, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely vivid image. I like the way you bring attention to the red bunch of leaves using focus.</td>', 'Lovely vivid image. I like the way you bring attention to the red bunch of leaves using focus.', '2009-11-14 06:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726161, 829484, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours, lovely composition and I love the surface tension on the water around the leaf. But, although I usually love shallow DOF, I think in this case, a deeper focal plane would be good, allowing the tip of the leaf to remain sharp too.</td>', 'Lovely colours, lovely composition and I love the surface tension on the water around the leaf. But, although I usually love shallow DOF, I think in this case, a deeper focal plane would be good, allowing the tip of the leaf to remain sharp too.', '2009-11-14 06:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726162, 828430, 3087, '<td valign="top">Love the surface tension int he water. Like the patterns of shadows in the water. And the sharp details of the veins of the leaf.</td>', 'Love the surface tension int he water. Like the patterns of shadows in the water. And the sharp details of the veins of the leaf.', '2009-11-14 06:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726164, 832292, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow! the detail in the leaf veins and the ice crystals is wonderful. And I love the composition and colour contrasts - warm and cold.</td>', 'Wow! the detail in the leaf veins and the ice crystals is wonderful. And I love the composition and colour contrasts - warm and cold.', '2009-11-14 06:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726173, 831475, 99263, '<td valign="top">Simple but striking close up with nice details and strong autumn colors. Nice back lighting.</td>', 'Simple but striking close up with nice details and strong autumn colors. Nice back lighting.', '2009-11-14 07:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726183, 832376, 99263, '<td valign="top">Nice original idea with good execution.</td>', 'Nice original idea with good execution.', '2009-11-14 07:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726335, 832611, 99263, '<td valign="top">Nice depth, bokeh and color in this one.</td>', 'Nice depth, bokeh and color in this one.', '2009-11-14 11:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726340, 831013, 100831, '<td valign="top">I love this!! The colors are great but the whole composition is really appealing and there are so many interesting things going on. Excellent. 9</td>', 'I love this!! The colors are great but the whole composition is really appealing and there are so many interesting things going on. Excellent. 9', '2009-11-14 11:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726341, 830002, 99263, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition but looks a tad over saturated to me.</td>', 'Lovely composition but looks a tad over saturated to me.', '2009-11-14 11:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726342, 832332, 100831, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea and well done.</td>', 'Very nice idea and well done.', '2009-11-14 11:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726343, 831048, 100831, '<td valign="top">I love the different textures and warm colors but the fog is icing on the cake (so to speak). Beautiful.</td>', 'I love the different textures and warm colors but the fog is icing on the cake (so to speak). Beautiful.', '2009-11-14 11:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726344, 832616, 100831, '<td valign="top">Lovely...</td>', 'Lovely...', '2009-11-14 11:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726346, 832629, 100831, '<td valign="top">Nice shadows, gotta love the gold too.</td>', 'Nice shadows, gotta love the gold too.', '2009-11-14 11:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726349, 832447, 99263, '<td valign="top">Uncomplicated and nice.</td>', 'Uncomplicated and nice.', '2009-11-14 11:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726351, 831861, 99263, '<td valign="top">Nicely done abstract.</td>', 'Nicely done abstract.', '2009-11-14 11:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726358, 831208, 99263, '<td valign="top">Very nicely captured. Quite unusual.</td>', 'Very nicely captured. Quite unusual.', '2009-11-14 11:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726359, 829450, 99263, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition. I like the colors and the highlights on the individual leaves in the foliage.</td>', 'Lovely composition. I like the colors and the highlights on the individual leaves in the foliage.', '2009-11-14 11:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726360, 832555, 99263, '<td valign="top">Nice colorful abstract busting with energy.</td>', 'Nice colorful abstract busting with energy.', '2009-11-14 11:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726361, 829083, 99263, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and reflections in this very nice composition.</td>', 'Lovely colors and reflections in this very nice composition.', '2009-11-14 11:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726363, 832620, 99263, '<td valign="top">Different and nice. Good depth and bokeh.</td>', 'Different and nice. Good depth and bokeh.', '2009-11-14 11:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726364, 832432, 100831, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 6 on my first pass but I''m bumping up to a 7 for the "pop". Excellent dof, details and bokeh, and the processing is consistent throughout. Although I think some of the natural feel of the leaf itself is gone, the colors are so wonderful that it doesn''t matter.</td>', 'I gave this a 6 on my first pass but I''m bumping up to a 7 for the "pop". Excellent dof, details and bokeh, and the processing is consistent throughout. Although I think some of the natural feel of the leaf itself is gone, the colors are so wonderful that it doesn''t matter.', '2009-11-14 11:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726365, 832139, 100831, '<td valign="top">Lovely - I think this would also work as a square crop, letting go of the left side and making the leaves a centerpiece, so to speak.</td>', 'Lovely - I think this would also work as a square crop, letting go of the left side and making the leaves a centerpiece, so to speak.', '2009-11-14 11:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726367, 830506, 100831, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.</td>', 'Nice colors.', '2009-11-14 11:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726371, 831229, 99263, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture of this little hummingbird surrounded by golden brown autumn foliage.</td>', 'Lovely capture of this little hummingbird surrounded by golden brown autumn foliage.', '2009-11-14 11:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726404, 832134, 99263, '<td valign="top">Beautiful carpet of autumn colors. Nice depth to this image.</td>', 'Beautiful carpet of autumn colors. Nice depth to this image.', '2009-11-14 12:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726440, 832061, 99263, '<td valign="top">Lovely bokeh and nice fresh yellows and greens.</td>', 'Lovely bokeh and nice fresh yellows and greens.', '2009-11-14 12:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726458, 831600, 99263, '<td valign="top">I like the way the light illuminates the leaves and the lens flare through the trees adds to this image artistically.</td>', 'I like the way the light illuminates the leaves and the lens flare through the trees adds to this image artistically.', '2009-11-14 12:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726464, 829484, 99263, '<td valign="top">Simple but nice and pure with great detail and color.</td>', 'Simple but nice and pure with great detail and color.', '2009-11-14 12:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726465, 832633, 99263, '<td valign="top">Lovely autumn forest floor scenery that reminds of a tapestry.</td>', 'Lovely autumn forest floor scenery that reminds of a tapestry.', '2009-11-14 12:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726495, 829801, 99263, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition with nice fine detail. Pity about the car on the left. It disrupts the tranquility of this scene somewhat.</td>', 'Lovely composition with nice fine detail. Pity about the car on the left. It disrupts the tranquility of this scene somewhat.', '2009-11-14 12:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726527, 832439, 99263, '<td valign="top">Lovely vibrant autumn colors in this nice composition. Great reflections too.</td>', 'Lovely vibrant autumn colors in this nice composition. Great reflections too.', '2009-11-14 12:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726533, 832591, 99263, '<td valign="top">Lovely bokeh and detail in this simple but striking image.</td>', 'Lovely bokeh and detail in this simple but striking image.', '2009-11-14 13:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726535, 832390, 99263, '<td valign="top">Simple but visually very pleasing image with nice detail,color and bokeh.</td>', 'Simple but visually very pleasing image with nice detail,color and bokeh.', '2009-11-14 13:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726538, 832629, 99263, '<td valign="top">Lovely backlit foliage with nice autumn shades and detail.</td>', 'Lovely backlit foliage with nice autumn shades and detail.', '2009-11-14 13:05:26.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5726540, 830240, 99263, '<td valign="top">Lovely rich autumn colors.</td>', 'Lovely rich autumn colors.', '2009-11-14 13:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726556, 832568, 99263, '<td valign="top">Yikes! scary pumpkin but I like the lovely autumn colors.</td>', 'Yikes! scary pumpkin but I like the lovely autumn colors.', '2009-11-14 13:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726585, 832623, 99263, '<td valign="top">Lovely bokeh and nice strong golden brown autumn colors. Good detail too.</td>', 'Lovely bokeh and nice strong golden brown autumn colors. Good detail too.', '2009-11-14 13:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726586, 832095, 99263, '<td valign="top">Lovely bokeh and nice strong golden brown autumn colors. Good detail too.</td>', 'Lovely bokeh and nice strong golden brown autumn colors. Good detail too.', '2009-11-14 13:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726620, 832043, 109393, '<td valign="top">foreground is a bit too bright. detracts from an otherwise cool shot.</td>', 'foreground is a bit too bright. detracts from an otherwise cool shot.', '2009-11-14 13:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726621, 831256, 109393, '<td valign="top">contrast it a bit overdone here</td>', 'contrast it a bit overdone here', '2009-11-14 13:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726624, 832153, 99263, '<td valign="top">Nice composition with rich autumn colors,good detail and a strong frame.</td>', 'Nice composition with rich autumn colors,good detail and a strong frame.', '2009-11-14 13:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726626, 832138, 109393, '<td valign="top">too bright</td>', 'too bright', '2009-11-14 13:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726628, 831815, 99263, '<td valign="top">Lovely rich autumn colors.</td>', 'Lovely rich autumn colors.', '2009-11-14 13:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726629, 830549, 109393, '<td valign="top">a bit bright which detracts from the detail, maybe it was shot at the wrong time of day.</td>', 'a bit bright which detracts from the detail, maybe it was shot at the wrong time of day.', '2009-11-14 13:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726632, 830531, 109393, '<td valign="top">a wee bit bright but cool. nice detail. good color. the brightness works well on the tombstones.</td>', 'a wee bit bright but cool. nice detail. good color. the brightness works well on the tombstones.', '2009-11-14 13:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726633, 832605, 109393, '<td valign="top">this photo is a bit hazy. needs to be sharper. a polarized lens would work well here</td>', 'this photo is a bit hazy. needs to be sharper. a polarized lens would work well here', '2009-11-14 13:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726655, 828914, 811, '<td valign="top">oooh, nice bokeh, and colors.</td>', 'oooh, nice bokeh, and colors.', '2009-11-14 14:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726659, 831601, 99263, '<td valign="top">Lovely natural framing with rich autumn colors and nice reflections.</td>', 'Lovely natural framing with rich autumn colors and nice reflections.', '2009-11-14 14:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726664, 830064, 811, '<td valign="top">nice colors and great composition.  looks like a bit too much noise reduction OR perhaps it is from compressing it down to submittable size, but it looks kinda, well, kinda like to much noise reduction happened.</td>', 'nice colors and great composition.  looks like a bit too much noise reduction OR perhaps it is from compressing it down to submittable size, but it looks kinda, well, kinda like to much noise reduction happened.', '2009-11-14 14:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726669, 832540, 18655, '<td valign="top">Great - love it - full of life, colours and emotion . 10 no doubt</td>', 'Great - love it - full of life, colours and emotion . 10 no doubt', '2009-11-14 14:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726678, 830215, 8637, '<td valign="top">Great catch and wonderful match for the challenge.  Has to ribbon!</td>', 'Great catch and wonderful match for the challenge.  Has to ribbon!', '2009-11-14 14:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726679, 832407, 8637, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best of the more impressionistic approaches to the challenge.</td>', 'This is one of the best of the more impressionistic approaches to the challenge.', '2009-11-14 14:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726680, 830681, 8637, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity and it "feels" like fall.</td>', 'I love the simplicity and it "feels" like fall.', '2009-11-14 14:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726682, 828836, 8637, '<td valign="top">Has to be one of the prettiest solitary trees in the compeitition.  Very nice.</td>', 'Has to be one of the prettiest solitary trees in the compeitition.  Very nice.', '2009-11-14 15:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726686, 832386, 83313, '<td valign="top">A unique take on the challenge. Not having much visual impact for me, I''m afraid. Seems a bit shaky with a strong color cast that I don''t care for. I do appreciate your effort to do something a little different from the pack, however.</td>', 'A unique take on the challenge. Not having much visual impact for me, I''m afraid. Seems a bit shaky with a strong color cast that I don''t care for. I do appreciate your effort to do something a little different from the pack, however.', '2009-11-14 15:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726687, 831477, 83313, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of one of my own favorite shots of my own, but better.</td>', 'Reminds me of one of my own favorite shots of my own, but better.', '2009-11-14 15:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726692, 832043, 83313, '<td valign="top">The contrast of lighting just does not seem to work for me somehow. I''m not sure what the real subject of the image is. My eye is being led... somewhere where there is not much to see. Perhaps a lower angle without that limb in the way would have shown the bridge to better advantage.</td>', 'The contrast of lighting just does not seem to work for me somehow. I''m not sure what the real subject of the image is. My eye is being led... somewhere where there is not much to see. Perhaps a lower angle without that limb in the way would have shown the bridge to better advantage.', '2009-11-14 15:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726693, 832576, 5585, '<td valign="top">Wonderful Photo...a lot of feeling</td>', 'Wonderful Photo...a lot of feeling', '2009-11-14 15:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726704, 830835, 5585, '<td valign="top">One that should do well...colors are great</td>', 'One that should do well...colors are great', '2009-11-14 15:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726705, 830609, 5585, '<td valign="top">Tried to accomplish this type of photo (oouldn''t do it and went another way)...I like the muted colors...I hope this does well for you, good luck.</td>', 'Tried to accomplish this type of photo (oouldn''t do it and went another way)...I like the muted colors...I hope this does well for you, good luck.', '2009-11-14 15:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726706, 831879, 5585, '<td valign="top">I''m always a sucker for this kind of photo...well done.</td>', 'I''m always a sucker for this kind of photo...well done.', '2009-11-14 15:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726712, 828904, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice photo with the leaves bith on and off the tree, but the border is hurting my eyes.</td>', 'Nice photo with the leaves bith on and off the tree, but the border is hurting my eyes.', '2009-11-14 16:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726732, 831768, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like all the greys here, as it gives in a somber dead look to all the trees.  Is it snowing or are those dust bunnies in the sky at the top?  Kind of DNMC-ish in a foliage challenge, but you kind of implied that from the title.</td>', 'I like all the greys here, as it gives in a somber dead look to all the trees.  Is it snowing or are those dust bunnies in the sky at the top?  Kind of DNMC-ish in a foliage challenge, but you kind of implied that from the title.', '2009-11-14 16:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726733, 832032, 91496, '<td valign="top">As an abstract photo this is very cool with all the shapes, textures, and interesting lighting.  Not getting a strong folige connection however.</td>', 'As an abstract photo this is very cool with all the shapes, textures, and interesting lighting.  Not getting a strong folige connection however.', '2009-11-14 16:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726737, 831789, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like how the light hits the tree in the center.  I applaud you for looking at interesting crops, however in this instance it does not work for me.  The extra sky at top and bottom is uniteresting and I''d like to see more of the tree on the left.</td>', 'I like how the light hits the tree in the center.  I applaud you for looking at interesting crops, however in this instance it does not work for me.  The extra sky at top and bottom is uniteresting and I''d like to see more of the tree on the left.', '2009-11-14 16:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726738, 831767, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the blurry artistic effect you achieve in the water.  The uppper part is a little washed out color-wise for me.</td>', 'I like the blurry artistic effect you achieve in the water.  The uppper part is a little washed out color-wise for me.', '2009-11-14 16:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726741, 832070, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the compsotion and the mix of tones here.  I think the file size hurt you here as the detail is very hard to see here.  These kinds of shot are hard to difficult to pull off with the DPC resolution and file size.</td>', 'I like the compsotion and the mix of tones here.  I think the file size hurt you here as the detail is very hard to see here.  These kinds of shot are hard to difficult to pull off with the DPC resolution and file size.', '2009-11-14 16:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726743, 830215, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection with the double arc of the branch.  The dynamic range is tough here with the dark ares (bird) too dark and the light areas (water) to bright.</td>', 'Nice reflection with the double arc of the branch.  The dynamic range is tough here with the dark ares (bird) too dark and the light areas (water) to bright.', '2009-11-14 16:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726747, 830002, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the round softness of the tree vs. the round hardness of the buildings.  The colors look a bit washed out or something.  It looks a little like halos around the trees and buildings.</td>', 'I like the round softness of the tree vs. the round hardness of the buildings.  The colors look a bit washed out or something.  It looks a little like halos around the trees and buildings.', '2009-11-14 16:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726748, 832611, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice out of focus areas with nice orange colors.  The trail marker is not really all that photogenic of a subject and does not seem to compliment the softness of the background.</td>', 'Nice out of focus areas with nice orange colors.  The trail marker is not really all that photogenic of a subject and does not seem to compliment the softness of the background.', '2009-11-14 16:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726751, 831766, 91496, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition with all the elements placed very well in the frame, especially the right hand tree balancing the left hand river.  The overall color palette is a little muted and did not say wow to me.</td>', 'Very nice composition with all the elements placed very well in the frame, especially the right hand tree balancing the left hand river.  The overall color palette is a little muted and did not say wow to me.', '2009-11-14 17:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726755, 829527, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice macro of a leaf.  Perhaps a less centered and vertical composition would have given it more life.  Also the brown edges seem to be drawing my eye from the nice details on the leaf.  Perhaps a pretty leaf would be more appropriate to this kind of backdrop and lightng.</td>', 'Nice macro of a leaf.  Perhaps a less centered and vertical composition would have given it more life.  Also the brown edges seem to be drawing my eye from the nice details on the leaf.  Perhaps a pretty leaf would be more appropriate to this kind of backdrop and lightng.', '2009-11-14 17:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726761, 831129, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the composition here.  Nice use of verticals on the trees and headstones.  The focus does not seem to be crisp.  The colors are a bit muted and do not provide a "wow" that is useful in these types of scenes.</td>', 'I like the composition here.  Nice use of verticals on the trees and headstones.  The focus does not seem to be crisp.  The colors are a bit muted and do not provide a "wow" that is useful in these types of scenes.', '2009-11-14 17:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726764, 830506, 91496, '<td valign="top">The soft focus here is both good and bad.  It gives the scene a neat kind of glow in the upper part of the trees which is very ethereal and majestic.  However on the road and foreground it just looks kind of out of focus to me and out of place.</td>', 'The soft focus here is both good and bad.  It gives the scene a neat kind of glow in the upper part of the trees which is very ethereal and majestic.  However on the road and foreground it just looks kind of out of focus to me and out of place.', '2009-11-14 17:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726767, 832390, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the patterns you have achieved here.  I applaud your use of narrow DOF, alhough in this instance, I think going a little wider and getting the edges of both leaves sharp may have been a more powerful image.</td>', 'I like the colors and the patterns you have achieved here.  I applaud your use of narrow DOF, alhough in this instance, I think going a little wider and getting the edges of both leaves sharp may have been a more powerful image.', '2009-11-14 17:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726774, 830228, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the color palette here with all the muted tones.  The sky and building (HDR?) go great together.  The composition may have worked better centered, as putting the building off center look awkward to me since htere is not added on the left by doing so.  The high power lines are kind of ugly, but I am not sure if the rules would let you clone out that much.</td>', 'I like the color palette here with all the muted tones.  The sky and building (HDR?) go great together.  The composition may have worked better centered, as putting the building off center look awkward to me since htere is not added on the left by doing so.  The high power lines are kind of ugly, but I am not sure if the rules would let you clone out that much.', '2009-11-14 17:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726777, 831815, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like all the colors and the crazy patterns going on here.  Not sure that the focus is sharp enough, this could just be the most detail you could get with the DPC file size.</td>', 'I like all the colors and the crazy patterns going on here.  Not sure that the focus is sharp enough, this could just be the most detail you could get with the DPC file size.', '2009-11-14 17:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
