(5726789, 832429, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like how you have caught the left hand side with the tree at a diagonal and all the sunlight shining through it.  I think the airplane trail kind of ruins the natural effect of the rest of the image.</td>', 'I like how you have caught the left hand side with the tree at a diagonal and all the sunlight shining through it.  I think the airplane trail kind of ruins the natural effect of the rest of the image.', '2009-11-14 17:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
