(5727694, 829418, 99263, '<td valign="top">Really fabulous shot with wonderful composition. Lovely autumn colors and fine detail. The meandering stream gurgling over the rocks strewn with fallen leaves is striking and the way you captured the waters flow is perfect. One of my favorites.</td>', 'Really fabulous shot with wonderful composition. Lovely autumn colors and fine detail. The meandering stream gurgling over the rocks strewn with fallen leaves is striking and the way you captured the waters flow is perfect. One of my favorites.', '2009-11-15 14:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
