(5727698, 832586, 99263, '<td valign="top">Lovely palette of different shades of green against which the orange leaves or are they flowers really pop. What an unusual and beautiful tree by the way and it has a very apt name. I like those wisps of "Old Man''s Beard" hanging from the branches and I like the fine detail in the bark too.</td>', 'Lovely palette of different shades of green against which the orange leaves or are they flowers really pop. What an unusual and beautiful tree by the way and it has a very apt name. I like those wisps of "Old Man''s Beard" hanging from the branches and I like the fine detail in the bark too.', '2009-11-15 14:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5727706, 829744, 99263, '<td valign="top">I love the effect you have achieved with this rather unusual processing. Like a fine Japanese pencil drawing on rice paper with lovely soft pastel colors. The inclusion of some yellows and orange colors would have strengthened the feeling of autumn.</td>', 'I love the effect you have achieved with this rather unusual processing. Like a fine Japanese pencil drawing on rice paper with lovely soft pastel colors. The inclusion of some yellows and orange colors would have strengthened the feeling of autumn.', '2009-11-15 14:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
