(5727716, 832431, 99263, '<td valign="top">Those blue mountain crags form a stunning backdrop for the autumn foliage and the birds in the shallow water of the lake/river. Really a very pleasant image to look at. It has an almost painting like feel to it with nice fine detail all round.</td>', 'Those blue mountain crags form a stunning backdrop for the autumn foliage and the birds in the shallow water of the lake/river. Really a very pleasant image to look at. It has an almost painting like feel to it with nice fine detail all round.', '2009-11-15 14:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
