(5727770, 832430, 99263, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image. Real classic and definitely one to frame and hang. I love the way the dog is gazing into the distance. I love the fine texture and detail and also the slightly muted colors.</td>', 'Wonderful image. Real classic and definitely one to frame and hang. I love the way the dog is gazing into the distance. I love the fine texture and detail and also the slightly muted colors.', '2009-11-15 14:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
