(5727888, 831256, 59029, '<td valign="top">great image, nice comp, but that level of saturation is just too much.  Yes, you want the colours to pop, but at the same time keep it looking fairly natural.</td>', 'great image, nice comp, but that level of saturation is just too much.  Yes, you want the colours to pop, but at the same time keep it looking fairly natural.', '2009-11-15 16:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
