(5728242, 832032, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. You know, I don''t even like abstract art, but your work is an exception... it evokes realities it doesn''t represent. Even though I''m certain who this is, I''m giving you a ribbon, because hell, this so clearly deserves it. I''m going to make you share a yellow. <br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'This is beautiful. You know, I don''t even like abstract art, but your work is an exception... it evokes realities it doesn''t represent. Even though I''m certain who this is, I''m giving you a ribbon, because hell, this so clearly deserves it. I''m going to make you share a yellow.  ', '2009-11-15 21:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5728244, 831861, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love how sometimes this is a picture of a cat, and sometimes an eye is opening to the sky of another universe. Congratulations, you get to share the Posthumous Yellow Ribbon with one of the greatest artists on this site.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'I love how sometimes this is a picture of a cat, and sometimes an eye is opening to the sky of another universe. Congratulations, you get to share the Posthumous Yellow Ribbon with one of the greatest artists on this site. ', '2009-11-15 21:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
