(5728554, 830211, 91496, '<td valign="top">I really like the abstract feel to this.  The way you filled the frame made the shot for me.  I guess I was in the minority as your lone 8, but there is always the possiblity that we are right and they are wrong :)</td>', 'I really like the abstract feel to this.  The way you filled the frame made the shot for me.  I guess I was in the minority as your lone 8, but there is always the possiblity that we are right and they are wrong :)', '2009-11-16 07:53:27.000000', NULL, 0),
