(5728622, 831739, 83313, '<td valign="top">Bob, you are really kicking butt and taking names lately! This didn''t come up for me in voting, but I can''t see that I would have given it any less than a 6, probably a 7.</td>', 'Bob, you are really kicking butt and taking names lately! This didn''t come up for me in voting, but I can''t see that I would have given it any less than a 6, probably a 7.', '2009-11-16 08:56:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(5728627, 832540, 53147, '<td valign="top">Man she is getting big fast. Lovely image.</td>', 'Man she is getting big fast. Lovely image.', '2009-11-16 08:59:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(5728631, 829083, 19083, '<td valign="top">Thanks for your comments. Yeah, the ISO. I was rushing home from work to try to get a shot before sundown. I made it with some light but most of it was behind the hills. ISO was 1000. I had a tripod and meant to try some shots at a lower ISO, but kind of blitzed as the light faded completely away. As it was, I had to push the saturation beyond my comfort range to get any color out.<br/>Had hoped to finish in the top 1/2 for my first ever entry, but still feel pretty good about the results.<br/>Thanks again.</td>', 'Thanks for your comments. Yeah, the ISO. I was rushing home from work to try to get a shot before sundown. I made it with some light but most of it was behind the hills. ISO was 1000. I had a tripod and meant to try some shots at a lower ISO, but kind of blitzed as the light faded completely away. As it was, I had to push the saturation beyond my comfort range to get any color out.Had hoped to finish in the top 1/2 for my first ever entry, but still feel pretty good about the results.Thanks again.', '2009-11-16 09:07:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5728634, 830835, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ah, it is the red cloister!  I shall have to check my pictures from there - I thought there was an "island" kinda thing across the middle of the water.  As I said, lovely photo of this place!  Congrats on the very high finish!</td>', 'Ah, it is the red cloister!  I shall have to check my pictures from there - I thought there was an "island" kinda thing across the middle of the water.  As I said, lovely photo of this place!  Congrats on the very high finish!', '2009-11-16 09:09:26.000000', NULL, 0),
