(5728754, 831839, 30982, '<td valign="top">Every once in awhile it is good to NOT give voters what they want - this is one of those times.  More people will see this in a challenge than in a side challenge or portfolio, and maybe one or two will stop, see something in an abstract that they hadn''t seen before, and will think a bit more about abstracts the next time they see them.</td>', 'Every once in awhile it is good to NOT give voters what they want - this is one of those times.  More people will see this in a challenge than in a side challenge or portfolio, and maybe one or two will stop, see something in an abstract that they hadn''t seen before, and will think a bit more about abstracts the next time they see them.', '2009-11-16 10:32:37.000000', NULL, 0),
