(5729714, 832243, 30861, '<td valign="top">Far out! Your first blue! This was one of only two 10''s I gave; the other finished 72nd :-) Congrats, awesome shot. Better than any other shot, IMO, it captured the true sense of luminous light that comes with autumn, not just the showy colors that piggyback on the season.</td>', 'Far out! Your first blue! This was one of only two 10''s I gave; the other finished 72nd :-) Congrats, awesome shot. Better than any other shot, IMO, it captured the true sense of luminous light that comes with autumn, not just the showy colors that piggyback on the season.', '2009-11-16 20:48:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5729715, 828705, 30861, '<td valign="top">I''m one of your 10''s. I think this is an outstanding image, and the woolly bear is absolutely one of the iconic events of autumn, at least where we are. I love the "caterpillar''s eye" perspective of this, and gave it one of only two 10''s I passed out this challenge. The other one got the blue...</td>', 'I''m one of your 10''s. I think this is an outstanding image, and the woolly bear is absolutely one of the iconic events of autumn, at least where we are. I love the "caterpillar''s eye" perspective of this, and gave it one of only two 10''s I passed out this challenge. The other one got the blue...', '2009-11-16 20:50:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(5729719, 832430, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is lovely, it''s more than just a picture of foliage, it resonates on many levels. The inquisitive tilt of the hound''s head is beyond perfection.</td>', 'This is lovely, it''s more than just a picture of foliage, it resonates on many levels. The inquisitive tilt of the hound''s head is beyond perfection.', '2009-11-16 20:55:40.000000', NULL, 0),
