(5729900, 832386, 1031, '<td valign="top">I keep forgetting that adding an intrusive border will provide the necessary ballast to sink to the bottom ... ;-)<br/> <br/>Not that I actually TRY for last-place finishes, more that I accept them as a frequent inevitability. Nice alternative take on the challenge -- I thought of fallen leaves, but I had already entered early and was too lazy to reconsider/reshoot.</td>', 'I keep forgetting that adding an intrusive border will provide the necessary ballast to sink to the bottom ... ;-) Not that I actually TRY for last-place finishes, more that I accept them as a frequent inevitability. Nice alternative take on the challenge -- I thought of fallen leaves, but I had already entered early and was too lazy to reconsider/reshoot.', '2009-11-17 00:18:10.000000', NULL, 0),
