(5729920, 830269, 107625, '<td valign="top">This needs to be a puzzle. Awesome.</td>', 'This needs to be a puzzle. Awesome.', '2009-11-17 01:14:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(5729923, 829980, 6519, '<td valign="top">My very first reaction was: "Whoa, that is over-processed!". On closer inspection, it was mostly the foreground grass on the left that caused that reaction.<br/>I agree with Brent that it is too busy, without a real subject to "sink my teeth into".<br/>You have some nice colors going, and very nearly (but not quite) a diagonal, something that usually works well in an image.<br/> <br/>I think concentrating on a smaller part of the scene (like around the big rock in the center) would have worked better.</td>', 'My very first reaction was: "Whoa, that is over-processed!". On closer inspection, it was mostly the foreground grass on the left that caused that reaction.I agree with Brent that it is too busy, without a real subject to "sink my teeth into".You have some nice colors going, and very nearly (but not quite) a diagonal, something that usually works well in an image. I think concentrating on a smaller part of the scene (like around the big rock in the center) would have worked better.', '2009-11-17 01:30:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(5729926, 830269, 18655, '<td valign="top">I can totally see why this is your favorite place.  Beautiful scene and well balanced with the nice warm tones of autumn. Congrats with a well deserved ribbon!</td>', 'I can totally see why this is your favorite place.  Beautiful scene and well balanced with the nice warm tones of autumn. Congrats with a well deserved ribbon!', '2009-11-17 01:33:35.000000', NULL, 0),
