(5747717, 832542, 29011, '<td valign="top">Oh you definitely captured it. Love the color it turns to in the Fall. One of my favorites in our garden. For those wondering, in the Summer it''s more of dark maroon purple and not as strikingly colorful when backlit.<br/></td>', 'Oh you definitely captured it. Love the color it turns to in the Fall. One of my favorites in our garden. For those wondering, in the Summer it''s more of dark maroon purple and not as strikingly colorful when backlit.', '2009-12-01 00:51:37.000000', NULL, 0),
